<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">MATTHEW</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thurchisa MATTHEW Miziek dungjûiin</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Thurchisa</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATTHEW</para>
  <para style="mt2">Miziek dungjûiin</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Thurchisa Matthew</char> miziek hin Jisua hih Sanminringpu leikhâm, Pathien chongtung muruoa mingei kôma a chong leikhâm a mintungna ani ti a misîr ani. Hi Thurchi Sa hih Jisua ânzirna le a omna Judangei ta rang vai nimaka, rammuol pumpui ta rang alei ni.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Matthew</char> miziek hih singtheitaka minsûk ani. Jisua inzirna thurchi'n ânphuta, masuole chu a Baptis changna le methêmna a tongnangei a misîra, hanchu Galilee rama a sinthonangei lâkin, Thurchisa a misîrna, a minchûna le mi a mindamnangei a misîr ani. Masuole chu hi Thurchisa hin Galilee ram renga Jisua Jerusalema ava chai thurchingei le Jisua hapta nûktak, mangtie ngei, jêmdela a omna roi ngei le ânthoinôkna thurchingei azoiphar tena a miziek ani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hi Thurchisa hin Jisua hih Minchupu inthangtak, Pathien Balam rilminthâr theina rachamneipu le Pathien Rêngram roi mi minchu ngâipu ani ti a minlang ani. A minchûnangei chu chonglupui rangngân lâkkhôm thei ani: (1) Muol chunga a thurchi misîr, Invân Rêngrama mi nina ngei nunchan rang ngei, sintumngei, satvurnangei le tuontungna roi ngei a misîr (bung 5-7); (2) Ruoisi somleinik ngei sinthona rilnangei (bung 10); (3) Invân Rêngram chungroia chongmintêkngei (bung 13); (4) Ruoisi-nina omtie chungroia minchûna (bung 18); (5) Atûnlâi zora mongna rang le Pathien Rêngram juong tung rang roia minchûna (bung 24-25) ngei hih an ni.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Richisûina le Jisua Khrista inzirna <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 1:1-2:23">1:1—2:23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baptispu John sinthona <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jisua Baptis changna le methêmna a tongna <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">3:13—4:11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galilee rama mipui ngei ranga Jisua sintho <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 4:12-18:35">4:12—18:35</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galilee ram renga Jerusalema <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 19:1-20:34">19:1—20:34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hapta nûktak le Jerusalem kôla <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 21:1-27:66">21:1—27:66</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pumapa inthoinôkna le ânlârnangei <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 28:1-20">28:1-20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua Khrista richibulngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Hi ngei hih Abraham jâisuon, David jâisuon Jisua Khrista richibulngei an ni.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-6a" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2-6a"/>Abraham renga Rêng David tena, anuoia anghin richibulngei hah adônin mintâng ani: Abraham'n Isaac a neia, Isaac'n Jakob a neia, Jakob'n Judah le a lâibungngei a neia; hanchu Judah'n Perez le Zerah a nei ngeia, (an nu chu Tamar ani) Perez'n Hezron a neia; Hezron'n Ram a neia, Ram'n Amminadab a neia, Amminadab'n Nahshon a neia; Nahshon'n Salmon a neia; Salmon'n Boaz a neia, (a nu chu Rahab ani) Boaz'n Obed a neia, (a nu chu Ruth ani) Obed'n Jesse a neia; Jesse'n Rêng David a nei ani. <verse eid="MAT 1:2-6a"/><verse number="6b-11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6b-11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6b-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-15">2 Rêng 24:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Rich 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:20">Jer 27:20</ref></char></note> David zora renga Israel mipui ngei Babylon suoka intânga an om tena anuoia anghin an richibulngei hah adônin mintâng ani: David'n Uriah lômnu leh Solomon a neia; Solomon'n Rehoboam a neia; Rehoboam'n Abijah a neia; Abijah'n Asa a neia; Asa'n Jehoshaphat a neia; Jehoshaphat'n Jehoram a neia; Jehoram'n Uzziah a neia; Uzziah'n Jotham a neia; Jotham'n Ahaz a neia; Ahaz'n Hezekiah a neia; Hezekiah'n Manasseh a neia; Manasseh'n Amon a neia; Amon'n Josiah a neia; Josiah'n Jehoiachin le a lâibungngei a nei ngei ani.<verse eid="MAT 1:6b-11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12-16"/>Hanchu, Babylon suoka an intâng suonûk renga Jisua suok tena hi anuoia angin richilbulngei adônin mintâng ani: Jehoiachin'n Shealtiel a neia; Shealtiel'n Zerubbabel a neia; Zerubbabel'n Abiud a neia; Abiud'n Eliakim a neia; Eliakim'n Azor a neia; Azor'n Zadok a neia, Zadok'n Achim a neia; Achim'n Eliud a neia; Eliud'n Eleazar a neia; Eleazar'n Matthan a neia, Matthan'n Jacob a neia; Jacob'n, Joseph, Mary inneipuipu hah a neia; ha Mary renga han Jisua Messiah an ti hih ajuong inzir ani, <verse eid="MAT 1:12-16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Masikin, Abraham renga David tena ruol sômleiminli ania; David renga Babylon tieng suoka an tuong ngei tena ruol sômleiminli ania; ma renga hah Messiah ânzir tena ruol sômleiminli ani.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Khrista ânzirna roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Mahih Jisua Khrista ajuong inzir tie chu ani. A nu Mary hah Joseph han ava bieka, in-annei mân, Ratha Inthiengin nâi a vonga,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:27">Luk 1:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Joseph hah zoratina mi diktak ani sikin mipui rietin Mary hah mâimôkshak rang nuom maka; masikin inrûktên an inbiekna setin mâkchien rangin a mintuo ani. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Hima roi hah a mindon lâitakin, a ramangin Pumapa Vântîrton inkhat a kôm a juong inlâra, a kôm han, “Joseph, David jâisuon, Mary hih lômnua nei rang chi no roh. Amanu nâivong hih Ratha Inthieng renga kêng ani. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Amanu han Nâipasal nei a ta, male a riming Jisua ni phuo rang ani. Ama han a mingei an nunsienangei renga a sanminring ngei rang sikin,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk 1:31</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Atûn hin Pumapa'n dêipu manga a lei misîr hah adikin ahong tung theina ranga hima ngei murdi hih ahong oma, <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Dôngmate inthienghiei hah inrâi a ta nâipasal nei atih, male a riming Immanuel phuo an tih,” (ma omtie chu, “Ei kôm Pathien aom tina ani.”)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa 7:14</ref> (LXX)</char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Masikin, Joseph ânthoi lehan, Pumapa vântîrtonin a tipe anghan, Mary hah lômnûn a nei zoi. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Aniatachu, a nâivong hah a nei mâka chu ompui mah. Hanchu, Joseph'n a riming hah Jisua a phuo zoi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:21">Luk 2:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Nisuotieng renga mivârngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Rêng Herod ânlal lâihan Judea rama Bethlehem khopuia Jisua ajuong inzira. Ânzirsuo, harenghan, ârsi tienga lekha inchû ngâi mivârngei senkhat nisuotieng renga Jerusalema an juonga <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>“Khotieng mo Judangei rêng ajuong inzir nâitesen hah a om? Nisuo tienga ama ârsi kin mua, ama chubaimûk rangin kin juong ani,” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Ma roi hah Rêng Herod'n a rietin chu, a mulungjîng sabaka, Jerusalema mi murdi khom an mulung ajîng sa ani. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Ochaisingei le Balam minchupungei murdi munkhatin a koibûm ngeia, an kôm han, “Khotieng mo Messiah ânzir rang?” tiin a rekel ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Hanchu, anni han a kôm, “Judea ram Bethlehem khopuia,” tiin an thuona, Dêipu'n hi anghin a lei mizieka:<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>“Judah ram sûnga Bethlehem,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mic 5:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">nangma Judah khopuilienngei lâia achîntak ni tet mak che;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">na sûng renga ruoipu alân zir rang ani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ki mi Israelngei ruoi rangpu hah.”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Masikin Herod'n nisuo tienga mivârngei hah a koi ngeia, ârsi ânlang zora tak hah anni renga a man theina rangin inrûktên ântongpui ngei zoi. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Hanchu hi chong hih bê'n anni hah Bethlehem'a a tîr ngei: “Se ungla, nâite hah asadimin va rok ungla, nin mûn chu mi hong ril nôk roi, masikin keima khom ama chubaimûk ke se theina rangin,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9-10"/>Hanchu an mâka, male an lampuia an sea, nisuo tienga ârsi dên hah an mu nôka. Ârsi hah an mûn chu an râiasân sabaka, idôr taka râisân mo an ni zoi! Nâite omna chung ridîn aphâk mâka chu inngam loiin an moton a ruoi ngei banga. <verse eid="MAT 2:9-10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Insûnga an va lûta, male a nu Mary leh nâite hah an va mua, khûkinbilin chubai an mûk zoi. Neinunpêk ranga an chôi, rângkachak, bero le myrrh (murrah) an kaisuoa, a kôm an pêk zoi.<verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Hanchu, Herod kôm tieng se nôk khâiloi rangin an ramangin Pathien'n inningna a pêk ngei sikin lampui danga an ram tieng an kîrnôk zoi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Egypt tieng an rot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Hanchu, anni ngei hah an mâk suole chu, Pumapa vântîrton inkhat Joseph kôm ramangin ajuong inlâra, a kôm han, “Herod'n nâite that rangin a rok rang kêng. Masikin inthoi inla, nâite le a nu hah tuong inla, Egypt rama rotpui ngei roh, hong nôk rangin nang ki ril mâka chu mahan omchien roi,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Joseph ânthoia nâite le a nu a tuong ngeia, hani jân renghan Egypt ram an pan kelen zoi. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Herod thi mâka chu mahan an omchien zoi. Pumapa'n dêipu bâia, “Ka nâipasal chu Egypt ram renga ko koi suok,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos 11:1</ref></char></note> a lei ti hah ajuongtung dikna rangin maha ahong om ani.<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nâipangngei thatin an om</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Herod'n nisuo tienga mivârngei han an huong ti a rietin chu a ningathik sabaka. Mivârngei kôm renga ârsi ânlang zora roi a riet dungjûiin Bethlehem le a revêla nâipang pasal kumnik nuoitienga murdi chu that riei rangin chong a pêk zoi.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Dêipu Jeremiah'n a lei misîr:<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Ramah khuoa in-iek miring rietin aoma,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Jer 31:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">Rangâisie taka chap miring hah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rachel'n a nâingei ranga a châ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">amanu hah tâi thei khâi mak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">an thi pe zoi sikin,” ti hah ahongtung zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Egypt ram renga an hongkîr nôk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Herod a thi suole chu, Pumapa vântîrton inkhat Egypt rama Joseph kôm ramangin ânlâra, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>a kôm, “Inthoi inla, nâite le a nu hah tuong inla, Israel rama se nôk ta roi, nâite that ranga bôkngei hah an thi zoi,” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Hanchu, Joseph ânthoia, nâite le a nu a tuonga Israel rama an se nôk zoi.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Aniatachu, Archelaus a pa Herod ruthûlin Judea rama rêng a chang ti Joseph'n a rietin chu ha taka se hah a chia. A ramangin rilin a om nôka, masikin Galilee ramhuol tiengkâng han an sea <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>khopui inkhat Nazareth an tia han anva om zoi. Hanchu dêipungeiin, “Ama hah Nazareth mi tîng an tih,” tia an lei ti hah adikin ahongtung ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mk 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:39">Luk 2:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:45">Joh 1:45</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Baptispu John tânghâi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joh 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Ma zora han Baptispu John, Judea ramchâra a honga male tânghâi a phuta, <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>“Nin nunsienangei renga inhei ta roi, Invân Rêngram anâi zoi,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:17">Mat 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mk 1:15</ref></char></note> a tia. <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref> (LXX)</char></note> John hih ani, Dêipu Isaiah'n:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Ramchâra mi inkhat tânghâi han,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Pumapa rang lamlien sin ungla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">a lôna rang lampui khom mintûn roi!’” tia a chungroi a lei misîr hah ani.<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>John a puonsilngei hah ût mula sin ania, savun kongkhit a khita, a sâk ngâi chu khâimimsiengei le rama khuoilutui ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Rêng 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Jerusalem renga, Judea ramhuol pumpui renga, le Jordan tuidung revêla ramtin renga mingei a kôm an honga. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>An nunsienangei an phuonga, male ama'n Jordan tuidunga a Baptis ngei zoi.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>John'n Phariseengei le Sadduceengei tamtak a kôm Baptis chang rangin an hong a mu lehan an kôm, “Murûl richingei, Pathien sepna juong chulna rang renga hih rotpai theina rangin tumo nangni ril?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Nin sietna renga nin inhei zoi ti riettheina rangin sinngei hah tho roi. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Male Abraham richisuonpârngei kêng kin ni tiin sepna renga rotpai thei rangin mindon no roi. Nangni ki ril, Pathien'n hi lungngei khom hih Abraham richisuonpârngei a min chang thei!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Joh 8:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Thingkungngei a ruzung renga phûr rangin reipui min râkchien sai kêng ani zoi; thingkung murdi mara sân ânra loi kai chu phûr an ta, meia vôrpai an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat 7:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Keima'n chu nin insîr zoi ti rietna rangin tuiin nangni ka Baptis ngâia, aniatachu ku nûka juong rangpu'n chu Ratha Inthieng le meiin nangni baptis a tih. Ama chu keima nêka roiinpui uol ok ani; keima chu a kekok chôi rangin luo inhoi mu-ung. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Bungei jâpna rangin relei a dôna, a ruijôl jâp minsâi liei a ta, a butakngei kai chu sapang sûnga thun a ta, arishi chu mei thithei ngâiloia hâl minmang a tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua baptis a chang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mk 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Ma zora lâihan John kôm Baptis chang rangin Jisua'n Galilee ram renga Jordan dunga a honga, <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Aniatachu, John'n khap rang a bôka, a kôm, “Nangman kêng mi ni Baptis anânga,” John'n, “kho angin mo ko kôm te no honga!” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Hannirese Jisua'n a kôm, “Atûn hin asa ti chien roh. Ma angdênin Pathien'n a minnângngei murdi chu ei tho rang ani,” tiin a thuona. Hanchu John a jôt zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Jisua Baptis a chang suo, harenghan, tui renga a hong jôka. Hanchu ama rangin invân ajuon onga, male Pathien Ratha hah vasu angin a juongchuma a chunga chuongin a mua.<verse eid="MAT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Hanchu, invân renga rôl ajuon ringa, “Mahih ka Nâipasal moroitak, a chunga ku mulung atâiriem ani,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Aph 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lap 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">Mat 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n methêmna a tongna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mk 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Male Jisua hah Diabol methêma a om rangin Ratha'n ramchâra a tuong zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:18">Heb 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:15">4:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Sûn sômminli jân sômminli sâk sâkloiin a om suolechu Jisua hah a vonchâm zoia. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Hanchu Diabol a honga, a kôm, “Pathien Nâipasal ni nîn chu, hi lungngei hih vâipôl chang rangin chongpêk roh,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Hannirese, Jisua'n a kôm han, “Pathien Lekhabu'n Miriem hi vâipôl korongin ring no nia, Pathien bâia chong hongsuokin kêng an a ring rang ani,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Bal 8:3</ref></char></note> tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Hanchu Diabol'n Jisua hah, Khopuilien Inthieng Jerusalema a tuonga, Biekin sîpinsângtaka a mindinga, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>male a kôm, “Pathien Nâipasal ni nîn chu nangma nethenin inchôm inla, Pathien Lekhabu'n ati anghan:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Lap 91:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Nu chungroia chu Pathien'n a vântîrtonngei chongpêk ngei a ta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">an kutngei leh nang lei modong an tih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">masikin ne kengei luo khom lunga nên sûi loina rangin,’ ” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Aniatachu Pathien Lekhabu'n, Pumapa na Pathien minsin no roh, ti khom ânziek sa,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Bal 6:16</ref></char></note> tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Male, Diabol hah muol insângtaka a tuonga rammuola rêngramngei murdi le an roiinpuinangei a min mua. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>A kôm, “khûkinbilin chubai mi ni mûkin chu hi ngei murdi hih nang pêk let ki tih,” a ti pea.<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Male Jisua'n a kôm, “Soitan, rotpai roh! Pathien Lekhabu'n, ‘Pumapa na Pathien vai chubaimûk inla, ama sin vai tho roh a ti!’” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Bal 6:13</ref></char></note> tiin a thuona. <verse eid="MAT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Masuole chu Diabol'n Jisua a mâka; male vântîrtonngei an juonga, ama an juong san zoi.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Galilee rama Jisua sintho a phutna roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mk 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Jisua'n, John an sûr ti a riet lechu, Galilee rama a thengpata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk 3:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Nazareth a mâka, Capernaum khopuia ava om zoia, mahah Galilee Dîl pang Zebulun le Naphtali ramhuola om ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:12">Joh 2:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Mahi dêipu Isaiah lei ti hah ahongtung adikna ranga ani:<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Zebulun ram le Naphtali ram,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15,16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">Isa 9:1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">tuipui panna lampuia, Jordan râl kângkhat tieng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilee, Jentailngei ram!<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Ijîng nuoia om mingei han</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">vâr roiinpuitak mûng an ta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Thina ram ijîng nuoia omngei chunga han</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">vâr hah hong êl atih.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Ma zora renga hah Jisua'n, “Nin nunsienangei renga inhei ta roi, Invân Rêngram hih anâi zoi sikin!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mat 3:2</ref></char></note> tiin thurchi misîr a phut kelen zoi.<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n ngasûrpungei minli a koi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mk 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Jisua'n Galilee dîl pang rûla a chai anghan ngasûrpungei lâibungsa inik a mu ngeia, Simon (Peter an ti) le anâipa Andrew, dîla lên leh nga an sûra. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Ko kôm hong ungla, miriem sûrna chang nangni minchu ki tih,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Voikhat rengin an lênngei an mâkraka, an jûi kelen zoi.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Ava se nôk uol vietin chu lâibungsa adang, Zebedee nâipasalngei Jacob le John ava mu ngei nôka. Anni ngei hah an pa Zebedee leh an rukuong sûnga an lei oma, an lênngei an lei sina. Jisua'n a koi ngeia, <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>male voikhat rengin rukuong le an pa mâkrakin, an jûi kelen zoi.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua minchuna, thurchi misîrna, le mindamna ngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Jisua'n Galilee ram pumpuia a sea, synagog in sûng ngeia a minchua, Rêngram Thurchi Sa a misira, mingei lâia natna le damloina jât tamtak a mindama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:35">Mat 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mk 1:39</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Ama chungroi hah Syria ram pumpuia ânthang zoia, masikin mingei han damloi murdi, natna jât tamtak le intaknangei renga an hong tuong ngeia: ramkhori sûrngei, risangol inveingei, phalkhatthi ngei, hah Jisua'n a lei mindam ngei pak ani. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Galilee ram le Khopui Sôm ngei renga, Jerusalem renga, Judea ram renga le Jordan râla ramngei renga mipui tamtak ama an jûi zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Muol chunga A chongril</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Jisua'n loko ngei hah a mûn chu muol chunga a kala, mahan ânsunga. A ruoisingei a kôla an hong intûpa, <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>male anni ngei hah a minchu phut zoi:<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Satvurna dik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>“Ratha tienga inrienga ânriet ngei chu satvur anni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">Invân Rêngram an ta ani sikin.<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Rathanvâingei chu satvur anni;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:2">Isa 61:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">Pathien'n rathanngamna a pêk ngei rang ani!<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:11">Lap 37:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Rangâiinchînngei chu satvur anni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">Pathien chonginkhâm an la man rang ani!<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa 55:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 55:2">2</ref> </char>
    </note> Pathien'n a minnângngei sin ranga ôina lientak dônngei chu satvur anni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">Pathien'n mulungchukna a pêk ngei rang ani!<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Mulungjûrpuina dôn ngei chu satvur anni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">Pathien mulungjûrpuina an chang rang ani!<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Mulung inthiengngei chu satvur anni;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:3-4">Lap 24:3-4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">Pathien an la mu rang ani!<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Inngêina ranga sintho ngei chu satvur anni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">Pathien'n ama nâingei tiin a la koi ngei rang ani!<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Pathien'n a minnângngei sin sikin nuomlona tuong ngei chu satvur anni;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:14">1 Pet 3:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">Invân Rêngram an ta ani!”<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>“Ku nûkjûingei nin nina sika min nangni an êroa, an nunuom nangni an loa, milak saloi ngeiin nangni an nôn tika chu satvur nin ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pet 4:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Nin râiminsân ungla, nin ta rangin râisânman lientak invâna darin aom sikin. Nin motona lei om dêipungei hah khom nunuomlona an lei tuong ngâi ani.” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Rich 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Sin 7:52</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Michi le vâr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></char>
    </note> “Mitin ta rangin michi angin nin ni. Aniatachu michi hih a âlna ahong dongin chu min âl nôk thei ni khâi mak. Mangmunboi ahong changa, masikin an paia, mingeiin an sirpol ngâi ani.<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>“Nangni ngei hah rammuol pumpui rangin vâr angin nin ni. Tângsîpa khopui aom chu inthup thei ngâi mak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Joh 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Tutên châti mochokin khuriâi nuoia dar ngâi mak ngei; manêkin chu in sûnga mi murdi a êlminvârna rangin châtidarna kêng an dar ngâi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mk 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luk 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">1 Pet 2:12</ref></char></note>Ma angdên han nin vâr hah mingei makunga vâr ngêt rese, hankêng nin neinun sa tho ngei hah mûng an ta, male invâna om nin Pa minpâk thei an tih.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balam chungroia minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>“Moses le Dêipungei Balam minchûnangei minboi ranga juongin ni be no roi. Ma ngei hah minboi ranga juong ni mu-unga, an minchûnangei ajuongtung dikna ranga kêng ki ni. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Pilchung le invân a om kâr chu Balam chong ânziek ahâng chînte mo, miziek dukriekte mo hi boi no nih, neinunngei murdi mongna ahongtung mâka chu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">neinunngei murdi mongna; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">an minchuna ngei murdi ahong tung dik mâka.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:17">Luk 16:17</ref></char></note> ti hi riettit roi. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Masikin tukhomin hi chongpêkngei lâia achîntak khom jômloiin, ma angdênin tho sa rangin midangngei khom a minchûn chu invân Rêngrama chu mi chîntak nîng a tih. Nikhomrese tukhomin Balam a jôma, ma angdênin tho sa rangin mi a minchûa anin chu invân Rêngrama chu mi lien nîng a tih. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Hanchu, Pathien lungdo sinna lama Balam minchupungei le Phariseengei nêkin taksôn-omin nin om vaiin kêng invân Rêngrama nin lût thei rang tiin nangni ki ril ani.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taksina chunga minchûna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>“Tienlâia mingei kôm chu, ‘Mi that no roh; tukhom mi that chu roijêkna makunga inding a tih,’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Jôk 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Bal 5:17</ref></char></note> tiin an ril ngâi ti nin riet. <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Ania, atûn keiman chu: Tukhom a lâibungpa chunga a taksîn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:22: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tukhom a lâibungpa chunga a taksîn; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhatngei chu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">tukhom taksi thona om loiin.</char></note> chu roijêkna makunga tuongin om a tih, tukhom a lâibungpa kôm, ‘Mangmunboipa!’ ti chu roijêkna makunga tuongin om a tih, male tukhom a lâibungpa kôm mangmunboi, amopa ti chu meidîla se rangin ichi aom ani. <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Masikin mâichâm motona Pathien kôm neinunpêk ne pêk rang lâitak khomin na lâibungpa'n nu chunga mulung hoiloina a dôn iti ni riettitin chu, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>mâichâm motona ne neinunpêk ne pêk rang hah mâk inla, inrangin sênla, na lâibungpa leh inngêina va sin bak inla, masuole chu hongkîr nôk inla Pathien kôma ne neinunpêk rang hah pêk roh.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>“Mîn dabi thôn nang an doia roijêkna muna nang an tuongin chu zora ala om sûngin nin bâiinkhamna hah inngêipui roh, roijêkna mun nin tung mân. Amuna voikhat pai na va tungin chu, ama'n roijêkpu kuta nang bâng a ta, misûrngei kuta nang bâng a ta, male jêl-ina khum nini rang ani. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Nangni ki ril, poisate tena luo lei nu thuon mâka chu ma muna han om tit ni tih.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inrê chungroia minchûna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>“Inrê no roh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Jôk 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Bal 5:18</ref></char></note> an lei ti hah nin riet. <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Ania, atûn Keiman chu: tukhomin nupang midit enin a ena, amanu hah luo rang a nuomin chu a mulungrîla amanu leh han an inrêa, theiloi changin aom zoi, tiin nangni ki ril ani. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:9">Mat 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:47">Mk 9:47</ref></char></note> Masikin ni mit chang tieng han nang aminpalin chu kêlpai inla, vôrpai kelen roh! Na takpum, pumpuia meidîla se nêkin chu na takpuma abâk inkhat ânsam hah chu nata rangin asa uol. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:8">Mat 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mk 9:43</ref></char></note> Nu kut changtieng nang aminpalin chu tanpai inla, pai kelen roh! Na takpum, pumpuia meidîla se nêkin chu na takpuma abâk inkhat ânsam hah chu nata rangin asa uol ani.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inmâkna chungroia minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mk 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Bal 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:7">Mat 19:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mk 10:4</ref></char>
    </note> “‘Tukhom a lômnu a mâkin chu mâkna lekha a pêk rang ani,’ an ti sa. <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mk 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note> Hannirese atûn Keiman chu: tukhom pasalin a lômnu hah roi danga niloiin, taksôn omloina sika a mâka anin chu a lômnu hah inrê a minchang ani; male mi lômnu mâksai inneipui nôkpu chu amanu hah a inrêpuiin theiloi a changsa ani, ti nangni ki ril ani.<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inkhâmnangei chungroia minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>“Tienlâia mingei kôm chu, ‘No chonginkhâm hah set nôn la, Pumapa makunga nên khâmna hah tho roh,’ an ti, tiin nin riet sa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Och 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Tel 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Bal 23:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Aniatachu atûn keiman chu, chonginkhâm nin sin zorân inkhâmna ite mang no roi. Invân sâmin khom, khomâkinsâm no roi, Pathien Rêngsukmun ani sikin;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:12">Jak 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">Mat 23:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>pilchung sâmin khom, khomâkinsâm no roi, a ke darna ani sikin. Jerusalem sâmin khom, khomâkinsâm no roi, ma khi Rêng roiinpuitak khopui ani sikin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:2">Lap 48:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Nin lu sâmin khom khomâkinsâm no roi, samsang inkhat luo hih nin minchek thei le nin minhâng thei aom loi sikin. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>‘Ani’ nônchu ‘Nimak’ vai ti roi, mapêna nin ti hah chu Saloipa Inkhat renga hong kêng ani.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phubaluok chungroia minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>“‘Mit ruthûla mit,’ ‘hâ ruthûla hâ,’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Jôk 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Och 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Bal 19:21</ref></char></note> an ti hah nin riet. <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Aniatachu atûn keiman chu: nin chunga asaloi tho ngei chunga phubaluok no roi. Tukhomin ni bieng chang tieng a bênin chu, voi tienga ni bieng khom minbên sa roh. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Tukhom nu sûng kancholi lâk rang a râivala roijêkna muna nang tuong rang a bôkin chu na kâncholiinchuol khom pêk sa roh. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Mi'n a puok kilometer khat pêl rangin nang a tiin chu kilometer inik pêlpe roh. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Mi'n neinun imini nang a zong zorân chu, maha a kôm pêk roh; mi lâkâi nang a zongpu hah lei min pûk roh.”<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Râlngei ranga lungkhamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27">Luk 6:27</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>“Na malngei lungkham inla, na râlngei mumâk roh,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Och 19:18</ref></char></note> an ti iti nin riet. <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Aniatachu atûn keiman chu: nin râlngei lungkham ungla, an nunuom nangni lo ngei hah chubai tho pe roi, <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>masikin invâna nin Pa nâingei nin hongni theina rangin. Ama'n misiengei le misangei chunga a nisa hah ân-angbangin a min suok ngâia, asa sinngei le asie sinngei chunga khom ruo a min juong pe ngei ngâi. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Nang lungkhamngei vai nu lungkham ngeiin te ithomo Pathien'n râisânman nang a pêk ranga? Mahah chu sum rusuongpungei khomin an tho ngâi! <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Hanchu, nin malngei kôm vai nin chongin te imo aliek nin tho uola? Mahah chu sonongngei khomin an tho ngâi! <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Invâna nin Pa asa akipphar anghan nangni khom nan satna hah akipphar ngêt rang ani!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Och 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:13">Bal 18:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Lungkhamna sin chungroia minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>“Nin sakhuo sintumngei nin sinngei hah miriem mitmua, mi mu rangin sin no roi. Ma neinunngei hah mi mu rangin nin sinin chu, invâna nin Pa kôm renga ite râisânman man no tunui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mat 23:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>“Masikin miriem a nângngei neinun nin pêkin, maha alienin minlang no roi, asarothol ngeiin mi minpâkna an chang theina rangin inkhôm inngeia le lamlienngeia an tho ngâi anghan tho no roi. Nangni ki ril an râisânman chu an man suozoi. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Hannirese, nangni chu miriem intakngei nin sanin, nin ruol satakngei khomin an riet loi rang lamin tho roi. <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Hanchu, inrûka sin tho nîng nin ta, male inrûka nin sintho mu ngâipu nan Pa han râisânman nangni pêk a tih.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chubaithona roia minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>“Chubai nin tho zorân, asarotholngei angin tho no roi! Mîn an mu theina rangin inkhôm inngeia le lamlien sîrngeia indinga chubaitho an minlut ngâi, adiktakin nangni ki ril, an râisânman chu pêkin an omsuo zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:10-14">Luk 18:10-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Aniatachu nangni chu chubai nin thôn, nin khâltana lût ungla, inkhâr khâr ungla, male mita mutheiloi nin Pa kôm chubaitho roi. Hanchu, inrûka nin sintho mu ngâipu, nin Pa han râisânman nangni pêng a tih.”<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>“Chubai nin tho zorân, sonongngei anghan chongkâmboi ngei mang no roi, anni ngei han an chubai tho sôt sikin an pathien'n riet uol rangin an mindon ngâi ani. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Anni angin om no roi. Nin ngên mân nin Pa'n nin nâng chu a rietsai kêng ani. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Hanchu, mahi nin chubai tho rang lam chu ani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Kan Pa invana mi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">Nirming inthieng mirit om rese.<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Na Rêngram juong tung rese;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">nu lungdo invâna mîn an sin angin nuoia mîn sin rese ngei.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Anîngtina kin nâng ngâi dôr sâk avien hin mi pêk roh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:11: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kin nâng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aviena rang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nangtûka rang.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Kin chunga sin minchâingei kin ngâidam anghan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">nang khomin kin minchâinangei mi ngâidam roh.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Sietna ranga methêmna tieng mi tuong nônla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">Asaloina renga chu mi mojôk roh,’ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhatngei an boksa </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Rêngram, le sinthotheina, male tuonsôt roiinpuina hi nangma ta ani. Amen.</char></note> tiin.<verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>“Nin chunga midangngei tho minchâi ngei nin ngâidamin chu, invâna nin Pa khomin nangni ngâidam a tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:25">Mk 11:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Aniatachu midangngei nin ngâidam nônchu, nin tho minchâina ngei nin Pa'n nangni ngâidam no nih.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bungêi chungroia minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>“Bu nin ngêi zorân, asarotholngei anghan inngûi mêl pêl no roi. Anni chu mi mitmua bu ngêia an inlang theina rangin an inngûi ngâi ani. Adiktakin nangni ki ril, an râisânman chu an man suozoi. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Nangni chu bu nin ngêi zora khomin nin mâi phie ungla, nin sam khûi roi, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>hankêng nin bungêi hah midangngeiin riet thei noni ngeia, mita mutheiloi nin Pa vaiin riet a tih. Male inrûka nin sintho mu ngâipu nin Pa han râisânman nangni a pêk rang ani.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Invâna rochon mintûp</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>“Pila, arenge le aêkin asiet theina, inrungeiin an murûk theina hin ninta rangin rochon mintûp no roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:2-3">Jak 5:2-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Manêkin invâna, arenge le thîr-êkin asiet thei khâiloina le inrungei khomin an murûk thei khâiloina muna ninta rangin rochon mintûp roi. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>No rochon omna muna han zoratin nu mulungrîl om atih.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Takpuma vâr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>“Mitngei hih takpum ranga châti angin ani. Nin mitngei hah asân chu nin takpum pumpui vârin sip a ta; <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Aniatachu nin mitngei hah asa nônchu nin takpum pumpui ajîngkhap rang ani. Masikin nin sûnga vâr hah ajîng nisenla, kho dôra jîngindên mo ani rang!”<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien le neinangei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>“Tutên puma inik tîrlâm chang thei noni ngei; ama han inkhat mumâk a ta; inkhat lungkham a tih, aninônchu, ama han inkhat midituol a ta, inkhat heng a tih. Pathien le sum sintho molop thei no tunui.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>“Masika han, nangni ki ril, nin ringna rangin imo ka sâkin ke nêk rang, aninônchu takpum rangin imo ki sillin ko bom rang tiin nin kângmindoi no roi. Sâknêk rangin ringna alut uol ok nimak mo? Sil le bom nêkin takpum alut uol nimak mo? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Chunga vuong vangei khi en roi; chimu tû mak ngeia, bu ât uol mak ngeia, sasiera bu mintûp uol mak ngei; hankhoma Invâna om nin Pa'n a donsui ngei tit ngâi! Nangni vâng chu, vangei nêkin nin lut uol ok nimak mo? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Tumo nin ringna chungroia a kângmindoi sika a ringna minsei uol<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:27: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ringna minsei uol; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ansâng uola ansôn.</char></note> thei rang nin ni?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>“Ithomo sil le bom rang sikin nin mulung nin min kâng? Rama pârngei insôn tie so en ta u: an ta rangin sin khom tho uol mâk ngeia, puon khom không mak ngei.<verse eid="MAT 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>“Aniatachu, nangni ki ril, Rêng Solomon luo a neina murdi leh ânvô khomin hima pârngei<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Rêng 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Rich 9:3-6</ref></char></note> mêlsa inkhat dôr hih enhoi mak. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Ram sûl avien a oma, nangtûka aboi nôka lungthu meia tuorip rang sûl luo hah ma angtak han Pathien'n a minvôn anînle, sil le bom khom nangni pêk uol ngêt no ni mo? Idôra taksônna chîn dôn mo nin ni!<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>“Masikin, khotieng renga mo ka sâk, ke nêk rang le ki sil ko bom rang ahong suok rang? Tiin nin kângmindoi no roi.<verse eid="MAT 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>“(Sonongngei chu ma neinunngei vai hah kêng an mindon ngâi.) Ma neinunngei murdi hah nin nâng tiin invâna nan Pa'n a riet let ngâi ani. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Manêkin chu, neinun dang dangngei nêkin Pathien Rêngram le nangnia a minnângngei hah mindon bak ungla, hanchu, ma neinunngei murdi ha chu nangni a pêk sa rang ani. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Masikin nangtûka rangin nan kângmindoi no roi; maha khom kângdoinangei ahun rang dôr a dôna. Sûn zeta intaknangei a hongchôi ngâi pêna chu bôk rang nâng mak.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Midangngei roijêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luk 6:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>“Mi chungroi jêk no ungla, Pathien'n nin chungroi jêk no nih, <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mk 4:24</ref></char></note>mi chungroi nin jêk angdênin Pathien'n nin chungroi jêk a ta, male midangngei chunga balam nin mang anghan nin chunga khom a mang rang ani. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Hanchu, ithomo ni mita thingbong om hah mindon loiin nu sûngsuok mita ronok chînte om hah nu mu hi? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Inmo ni mita thingbong om chienin nu sûngsuok kôm, ‘Rangâihoitakin, ni mita ronok chînte hah nang pai pe rong,’ ni ti ngam? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Nangma asarothol! Ni mita thingbong hah pai bak inla, hanchu, nu sûngsuok mita ronok chînte aom pai rangin ânthârlakin mu thei ni tih.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>“Uingei kôm neinun inthieng hah pêk no ungla, hong inhei an ta nangni pêt an tih. Vokngei makunga khom nin lungmantam hah vôr no roi, an kên chîlpol an tih.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zong, rok, tôk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>“Zong ungla pêkin om nin tih, rok ungla man nin tih; tôk roi, inkhâr nangni mo-ong pe nîng atih. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Tukhom a zong kai chu pêk nîng an ta, a rok kaiin chu man an ta, a tôk kai chu inkhâr mo ong pe nîng atih. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Nangni pangei lâia tukhomin nin nâingei vâipôl nangni zong senla ngei, lung nin pêk rang mini? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Aninônchu, nga nangni zong senla ngei, murûl nin pêk rang mini? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Nangni misie ngeiin luo nin nâingei neinun sa pêk nin rietin te, invâna nin Pa vângin chu a zongngei kôm neinun sa a pêk mintam bâk rang na!<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>“Mîn nin chunga an sin rang nin nuom tak hah mi chunga khom sin roi: mahi Moses Balam le dêipungei minchûna omtie chu ani.” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:31">Luk 6:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mokot ân-ep</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>“Mokot ân-epa han lût roi, meidîl mokot chu ânzara, a lampui khom ahoia, a se khom tamtak an ni sikin. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Aniatachu ringna mokot chu ân-epa, asena lampui khom ântaka, aman ngei khom mi tômte an ni.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thingkung le amarangei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>“Dêipu dikloingei renga indîn roi; pêntieng chu belri angin nin kôm an honga, ania an sûngtieng chu melangngei tatak angin an ni. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Ma ngei hah chu an sinthoa riet kelen nin tih. Riling rângngei han grape inra ngâi maka, riling kungngeia khom theichangngei inrâ ngâi maka. <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Thingkung asa chu amara khom asa ngâi, thingkung saloi chu amara khom asiet ngâi ani. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Thingkung adamin chu amara siet ngâi maka, thingkung adamloiin chu amara sa ngâi mak ani. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Thingkung murdi amara saloi chu an phûra meia an vôrpai ngâi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mat 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Luk 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Masikin dêipu dikloingei chu an sinthoa riet thei nin tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat 12:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nangni riet tet ngâi mu-ung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>“Pumapa, Pumapa, mi ti papai murdi invân Rêngrama lût noni ngeia, invâna ka Pa lungdo sinngei kai kêng an lût rang ani. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Roijêk Nikhuo ahong tungin chu mi tamtakin, ‘Pumapa, Pumapa! Ni rimingin Pathien thurchi kin misîr ngâia, ramkhoringei kin rujûl ngâia, sininkhêl khom mun tamtaka kin sin ngâi!’ la tîng an tih. <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Ma tikin chu keiman an kôm, ‘Nangni riet tet ngâi mu-ung. Ko kôm renga rotpai roi, nangni misiengei!’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Lap 6:8</ref></char></note> la tîng ki tih.<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">In sinpu inik ngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>“Masikin tukhomin hi ko chongngei hih a rieta jôm chu mivâr lungpui chunga in sinpu angin ani. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Ruo ajuonga, tui ahong liena, phâivuo ahong râta, ma in hah ahong nama. Aniatachu inlet mak, lungpui chunga sin ani sikin.<verse eid="MAT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>“Hannirese, tukhom hi ko chongngei a rieta, jômloi chu amo sietsâi chunga in sin angin ani. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Ruo ajuonga, tui ahong liena, phâivuo ahong râta, ma in hah ahong nama, ânleta. Ânlet tie khom ana sabak ani!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua rachamneina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:28,29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mk 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Luk 4:32</ref></char>
    </note>Jisua'n ma neinunngei hah a misîr suole chu loko ngeiin a minchuna hah an kamâm sabak ani. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>Ama chu Balam minchupungei angin niloiin; manêkin chu, rachamneina leh mi a minchu ani.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mi phâr inkhat a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mk 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Jisua hah tâng renga a juong chum lehan chu mipui tamtakin an jûia. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Hanchu a kôm mi phâr inkhat a honga, a makunga khûkinbilin, “Pu, nu nuomin chu, mi ni minthieng thei,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ni minthieng thei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hi natna hih miriem balama inthiengloiin a sin ngâi tiin be ani.</char></note> a tia.<verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Jisua'n a kut a hongsôna, a tôna, “Ku nuom, Inthieng ta roh!” tiin a thuona. Harenghan a phâr hah ahon thieng kelena. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Male Jisua'n a kôm han, “Rangâi roh! Tute ril no roh, hannirese, Ochai kôm thengpat inla, va min en roh; hanchu mi murdîn na damzoi, ti an rietna rangin Moses'n inbôlna pêk ranga a lei khâmsai hah va pêk roh a tipea.” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Och 14:1-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Rom râlmi ruoipu tîrlâm a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Jisua capernaum khuoa a hong lûtin chu, Rom râlmi ruoipu ahon tongpuia san rangin ânvûia: <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>“Pu, ki tîrlâm damloiin insûnga jâlmuna sînginsa theiloiin ana sabakin aom,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Jisua'n, “Hong ka ta mindam ki tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Ruoipu han a kôm, “O Pu, ma anghan nimak,” tiin a thuona. “Ki ina chu nu lûtna ngâi jât nimak. Chongbâi korongin tiin la ki tîrlâm dam kelen a tih. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Kei khom ruoipu inchungtak rachamneina nuoia om ki nia, male ku nuoia khom râlmingei an oma. Mi inkhat kôm, ‘Se roh!’ tiin chong ke pêkin chu a se ngâia, midang inkhat kôm ‘Hong roh!’ tiin chong ke pêkin chu a hong ngâi; male ki tîrlâm kôm khom, ‘Mahi sin roh!’ ki tiin chu a sin ngâi.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Jisua'n ma chong hah a rietin chu a kamâm sabaka, loko a jûingei kôm han, “Nangni ki ril, Israelngei lâia khom tute hima dôra taksônna dôn hi chu la mu tet ngâi mu-ung. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Adiktakin nangni ki ril, nisuo tieng le nitâk tieng renga mi tamtak hong an ta, Abraham, Isaac, Jacob ngei kôm invân Rêngrama ruolhoia insung an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:29">Luk 13:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Aniatachu Rêngram nâingei hah chu pêntieng ijînga paiin om an ta, male mahan chap le hâ rielin om an tih.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk 13:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Male Jisua'n râlmi ruoipu tîrlâm kôm han, “Ni ina se ta roh, ni iem angin nata rangin sin nîng atih,” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Hanchu ma mit misim kongkâr han râlmi ruoipu tîrlâm hah a dam zoi.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mi tamtak a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mk 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Jisua hah Peter ina a sea, Peter tarpi jâlmuna jâlin ritun damloiin a juong mua. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Amanu kut hah a tôn pea, a mintun hah a mathâna, male ânthoia a sin a tho pe zoi ani. <verse eid="MAT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Kholoi ahong nînchu, mipui ngeiin, Jisua kôm ramkhori sûr mi tamtak an hong tuonga. Jisua'n chongbâiin ratha saloi ngei hah a notpaia, male damloi murdi khom an dam sa zoi. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Dêipu Isaiah'n, “Ama lelên ei natna ngei a lâk paia, ei damloina ngei a pêl zoi,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa 53:4</ref></char></note> tia alei misîr hah ahong tung adik theina rangin maha a tho ani.<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua jûi rang a bôkngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Jisua'n mipui ngei an hong ûm a mûn chu, dîl râl tienga inkân rangin a ruoisingei chong a pêk ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Balam minchupu a kôm ahonga. “Minchupu,” “Ne sena muntina nangma leh se rangin inthoksai ki ni zoi,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Jisua'n a kôm han, “Sialngei kuo an dôna, vangei khomin rubu an dôna, aniatachu Miriem Nâipasal chu a lu minngamna rang luo dôn mak,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Midang inkhat, ruoisi lâia mi han a kôm, “Pu, insûnga mi min se nôk inla, ka pa la vaphûm bak hi rong,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Jisua'n a kôm han, “Ni jûi roh, mithi ngeiin an mithi champui chu phûm rese ngei,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n phâivuopui a ngomindâi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mk 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Jisua rukuong chunga a chuonga, a ruoisingei khom ama leh an se sa. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Inningloiin phâivuopui râttak hah dîl ahong dea, male rukuong hah ngîm rang dôrin tuidâr ânsoka. Aniatachu Jisua chu a lei inphara. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Ruoisingei hah a kôm an sea, an va kaithoia. “Pumapa, mi sanmojôk ta roh! kin thi rang kêng ani zoi!” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Jisua'n an kôm han, “Ithomo nin chi bâka?” “Nin taksôna dôn khom hi idôrtaka chîn mo ani zoi!” tiin a thuona. Hanchu ânthoia, phâivuopui le tuidârinsok hah mong rangin chong a pêka, male chu ânthim ngung zoi.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Mi murdi'n an kamâm sabaka, “Hi mi hih kho anga miriem mo ani hi? Phâivuopui le tuidârinsok ten khom a chong an jôm hi!” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n ramkhori sûr mi inik a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mk 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Dîl râl tieng Gadara rama Jisua a hongtung lehan, ramkhori sûr mi inik thân renga hongsuok ngeiin an intongpuia, Ma ngei hah chi an om sikin ma lampuia han tute se ngam ngâi mak ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Harenghan anni hah an in-ieka, “Pathien Nâipasal, imo mi lo rang ni ti? Zora khâm atung mân dûk mi tho ranga juong mo ni ni?” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Ala bâkloina han vok pâlpa sâk rok an oma. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Masikin ramkhoringei han, “Mi ni rujûl rangin chu vok pâlngei sûnga son mi min se roh,” tiin Jisua an ngêna.<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Jisua'n, “Se roi,” a tipe ngeia; hanchu an jôka, vokngei sûnga an va lûta. Vok pâl murdi hah dîl rakham rôlsora an tânna, dîla an tâkriei zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Vok donsûi mingei hah an tânna, khopui sûnga an sea, a thurchi anrêngin an va misîra, ramkhori sûrngei chunga neinun omtie ngei murdi khom hah an va misîr zoia. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Masikin khopui renga mi murdi Jisua intongpui rangin an suoka; male an va mua anin chu, an ram renga jôkpai rangin an ngên zoi.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mi phalkhatthi a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mk 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Jisua rukuonga a chuonga, dîl râl rakânin a omna khopui tieng a kîr nôka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">a omna khopui: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Capernaum (see 4:13)</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>mahan mi senkhat ngeiin phalkhatthi a jâlmun leh a kôm an hong rojôna. Jisua'n taksôn an dôntie hah a mua, phalkhatthipa kôm han, “Ka nâipasal rathanngam takin om roh! na nunsiengei ngâidam ani zoi,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Hanchu Balam minchupu senkhat ngeiin an mulungrîlin, “Hi mi hin Pathien a rilsiet kêng!” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Jisua'n an mulungrîla an mindon ngei hah a lei rieta, masikin an kôm han, “Ithomo ma anga neinun saloi hah nin mulungrîla nin mindon? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>‘Nu nunsiengei ngâidam ani zoi,’ nônchu, ‘Inthoi inla, lôn ta roh,’ ti hih kho hi mo a ti abai uol? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Miriem Nâipasal hih pilchunga nunsiengei ngâidam theina rachamneina a dôn, ti nangni lei min mu rong” a tia. Masikin phalkhatthipa kôm han, “Inthoi inla, na jâlmun luok inla, ni ina se ta roh!” a tipea.<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Ha mi hah ânthoia male a ina a se zoi. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Mipui ngei han maha an mûn chu, an chia, miriemngei kôma ma anga rachamneina pêkpu Pathien an minpâk zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Matthew a koi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mk 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Jisua'n ha mun hah a mâka, a senân sum rusuongpu inkhat a riming Matthew an ti, a sukmuna ânsung lâitak a mua, a kôm, “Ni jûi roh,” a tipea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Matthew hah ânthoia, a jûi kelen zoi.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Jisua hah Matthew ina bu a nêk lâitakin,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Matthew ina; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama sunga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(ma hah, Jisua) </char><char style="fq" closed="false">in.</char></note> sum rusuongpu tamtakngei le mitelloi ngei an honga, Jisua le a ruoisingei dosânga bu an nêkpui ngei sa zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luk 15:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Pharisee senkhat ngeiin maha an mûn chu a ruoisingei kôm han, “Ithomo nangni minchupu'n hi anga mingei leh bu a nêka hi?” tiin an rekel ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Jisua'n an chong hah a lei rieta, an kôm han, “Mi dam ngeiin doctor nâng ngâi mak ngeia, mi damloi ngei vaiin kêng an nâng ngâi. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Pathien lekhabu'n: ‘Lungkhamna kêng ku nuom, inbôlna sa ngei nuom mu-ung,’ a ti hih, se ungla a omtie va riet roi. Midikngei ralam ranga juong ni mu-unga, midikloingei ralam ranga juong kêng ki ni,” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:7">Mat 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref></char></note> tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bungêi chungroia chongrekel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mk 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Male, Baptispu John nûkjûi ngei Jisua kôm an honga, “Ithomo keini le Phariseengei hin bungêi kin tho bang ngâia, na ruoisingei rêkinte an ngêi tet ngâi loi?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Jisua'n an kôm han, “Inneina sâknêk thona taka khuolmingei hah moipumapa an kôm aom sûngin an beimindong rangin nin mindon mini? Ni thei no ni! Hannirese, an kôm renga moipumapa an tuong pai pe nikhuo la tung ata, ma tikin chu bu la ngêi an tih.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>“Tutên puon muruo hah puon thar hâr leh chitpho ngâi mak ngeia, puon thar hah inchirup ata, puon an ongna hah manêkin lien uol nôk atih. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Tutên uain thar savun ûm muruoa thun ngâi mak ngeia, thun ngân senla, uain thar han savun ûm hah mûtkhoi ata, uain le savun ûm hah mangnaboi chang atih. Manêkin chu uain thar chu savun ûm thara an thuna, an ruonin asa ngâi a tia.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zairus nâinupang le Jisua puonmor tôn nuvengte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mk 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Jisua'n hi chong hih a misîr lâitakin, Juda ruoipu inkhat a honga, a makunga, khûkinbilin a kôm han, “Ka nâinupang atûn renghan a thia; aniatachu hong inla, a chunga nu kut minngam inla, hong ring nôk a tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Masikin Jisua ânthoia male a jûia, a ruoisingei khom ama leh an se sa.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Nuvengte inkhat kum sômleinik hulloia damloinu han Jisua nûka a honga male a puonmor a tôna. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Amanu nanâkin “A puon morte luo khom tôn inlang chu dam kelen ki tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Jisua ânhei titira male amanu hah a mua, a kôm, “Ka nâinupang rathanngam takin om roh! na taksônna hih na dampuina ani,” a tia. Ha mit misim kongkâr han nuvengtenu hah a hong dam zoi.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Hanchu, Jisua hah ruoipu ina han a lûta. Berlem tum ngâi ngei le mithi-uop mipui kuorchok omngei hah ava mûn chu an kôm han, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>nin rêngin “Jôkpai roi! Nupangte hih athi nimaka, a in kêng!” a tia. Hanchu anni han ama hah an munuisana. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Hannirese, mipui ngei an notpai ngei suole harenghan, Jisua hah nupangte omna khâltana han a lûta a kut a sûr pea nupangte hah a hon thoi zoi. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Ma roi hah ma ram pumpuia han ânthang zit zoi.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mitcho inik a mindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Jisua'n ma mun hah a mâka, ava sên chu mitcho inikin an jûia, “David Nâipasal, inrieng mi mu roh!” tiin ân in-ieka.<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Jisua insûnga a lûtin chu, mitcho inik ngei hah a kôm an honga, male Jisua'n an kôm, “Nangni mindam thei ki tih, ti nin iem mo?” tiin a rekel ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">“O kin iem, Pu!” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Male Jisua'n an mitngei a tôna, an kôm, “Nin iem anghan nin chunga tung rese!” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Hanchu an mit ahong vâr pe ngei zoi. Jisua'n, “Mahi tute kôm ril no roi!” tiin chong a be ngei sabaka.<verse eid="MAT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Hannirese, anni ngei hah an sea, ma ram pumpuia han Jisua chungroi hah an va mazarzit zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n pasal chong theiloi a mindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Ha mingei hah an mâkin chu, mi senkhat ramkhori sûr chong theiloi inkhat Jisua kôm an hong tuonga. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Aniatachu ramkhori hah notpai ani suole, harenghan ma miriem hah a hong chong thei zoia, mi murdi'n an kamâm sabak zoi. “Israelngei lâia hima anga mi reng hih la mu ngâi mak me!” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Aniatachu Phariseengeiin chu, “Ramkhoringei an ulientakpa'n kêng Jisua hih ramkhori rujûl theina ranak a pêk ani hi,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:5">Mat 10:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luk 11:15</ref></char></note> an tia.<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mipui ngei inriengmuna a dôn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Jisua'n khopuingei le khuo chîn ngeia a chai titira. Synagog inngeia a minchua, Rêngram Thurchi Sa a misîra, damloi murdi le natna jât tamtakngei a mindama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mk 1:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:44">Luk 4:44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Tel 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Rêng 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Rich 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Ezek 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mk 6:34</ref></char></note> Mipui ngei hah a mûn chu, a mulungrîla anni ngei inriengmunân a sipa, belringei ahôlpu boi angin, kângdoiin le san rang boiin an om anni sikin. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Masikin a ruoisingei kôm han, “Bu ât rang chu atam sabaka, aniatachu, a mintûp ranga sinthopungei chu tômte an ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37-38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:2">Luk 10:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Masikin a bu ât ranga sinthopu ngei a juongtîrna rangin bu pumapa kôm han chubai tho roi,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Tîrton sômleinik ngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mk 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Jisua'n a ruoisi sômleinik ngei hah a koitûp ngeia, ratha saloi ngei rujûlpai theina le damloina le ri murdi mindam theina ranak a pêk ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Tîrton sômleinik ngei riming chu hi ngei hih an ni: Amotontaka Simon (Peter an ti) le a nâipa Andrew; Jebedee nâipasal inik Jacob le a nâipa John, <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Philip le Bartholomew; Thomas le chôiruol rusuongpu Mathew; Alphaeus nâipasal Jacob le Thaddaeus; <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Canan mi Simon le a minsûrpu Judas Iscariot ngei an ni.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sômleinik ngei an sintho rang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mk 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Hi miriem sômleinik ngei hih Jisua'n a tîr ngeia, an kôm hi angin a ril ngeia: “Jentailngei rama le Samari mingei khopuingeia chu se no roi. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Manêkin, Israel mingei lâia belri inmangngei kôm nin se rang ani. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Se ungla, ‘Invân Rêngram chu anâi zoi!’ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-12">Luk 10:4-12</ref></char></note> tiin va misîr roi. <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Damloingei mindam ungla, athi ngei kaithoi ungla, aphârngei minthieng ungla, ramkhoringei rujûlpai roi. Manboia nin man ania, manboi nanâkin pêk roi. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Nin pepa rângkachak sumdâr mo, ruphâi mo, sumsen mo chôi no roi; <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>nin chaina rangin cholite mo, kancholi bob mo, kekok bob mo, khiengrol bob mo chôi no roi. Sinthopungei chu an nângngei hah pêk rang ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Kor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>“Khopuia mo, khochinna mo nin lûtin nangni mintung rang nuoma nangni lei phâm mi rok ungla, ma mun hah nin mâknôk mâka chu ama kôm han om tit roi. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Insûng nin lûtin chu, ‘Nin chunga rathanngamna om rese,’ ti roi. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Ma ina omngei han nangni an lei modômin chu nin rathanngamna chibaimûkna hah an chunga tung rese; hannirese nangni an lei modôm nôn chu nin chibai chongbâi hah lâk mikhîr nôk roi. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Male, kho in khoma, kho khuo khoma nangni an lei phâm noa, nin chong an rangâi nôn chu ma mun hah mâkrak ungla, nin kea pildi hah không mathâk roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Sin 13:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Adiktakin nangni ki ril, Roijêk Nikhuon chu ha khopuia mingei tuong rang nêkin chu Pathien'n Sodom le Gomora khopuia mingei tuong rang chu inriengmuna minlang uol a tih!” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Aph 19:24-28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuomlonangei hongtung rang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mk 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>“Rangâi roi! Melang pâl kâra belri om angin nangni ki tîr ani. Murûlngei anghan vârin le vasu-ngei anghan nuninêmin nin om ngêt rang ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:3">Luk 10:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Aniatachu indîn roi, nangni sûra, roijêknamuna nangni tuonga, synagog inngeia nangni vîk rang an om rang sikin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:9-11">Mk 13:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luk 12:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">21:12-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Keima sika roijêkpungei le rêngngei makunga lân ding nin tih, anni le Jentailngei Thurchi Sa nin misîr pe ngei theina rangin. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Nin chung roijêk ranga nangni an tuong tika, imo nin ti rang aninônchu kho angin mo nin ti rang lei mindonin nan kângmindoi no roi; azora ahong tungin chu nin ti rang hah pêkin om nin tih. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Chong nin ti rang ngei hah nangni nin chong nino nia; nin Pa Ratha renga juongin nangnia a chong rang ani.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>“Miriemngeiin an lâibungngei nanâk khom that rangin la minsûr an ta, ma angdên han pangei khomin an nâingei la minsûr sâng an ta; nâingei khomin an nulepangei doi an ta male that ngei an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:12">Mk 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:16">Luk 21:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Keima sikin mitinin nangni mumâk an tih. Aniatachu tukhom among dêna tuongdierpu chu sanminringin om an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Mat 24:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mk 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:17">Luk 21:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Khopui inkhata an nuom nangni an lôn chu khopui danga rotpat roi. Adiktakin nangni ki ril, Miriem Nâipasal a juong mân Israel rama khopuingei murdia nin sintho zoi no tunui.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>“Inchulâi hah a minchupu nêkin lien uol mak; suok khom a pu nêkin lien uol mak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Joh 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Masikin inchulâi hah a minchupu angin hong om rang hah a mulung a minchuk rang ani, tîrlâm khom a pu angin hong om rang hah a mulung achuk rang ani. In pumapa luo Beelzebul, tiin an koiin te, a in mingei vang chu khodôra riming saloi uolin mo an koi rang ni zoi!” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luk 11:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tumo chiruo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>“Masikin miriemngei hah chi no roi. Atûna thupa om murdi lân lang let ata, ippa om murdi la phuong nîng atih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mk 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luk 8:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Ajînga nangni ki ril hih sûnkhovâra misîr ungla, kuor kunga nin riet hih inchungsîpa chuongin tânghâi roi. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Taksa thata ratha that theiloi ngei chu chi no ungla; manêk han Pathien meidîla taksa le ratha anruona that theipu hah chi roi. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Invâ inik poisakhatin nin rochôk thei, nikhomrese, an lâia inkhat luo nin Pa rachamin ninôn chu pilchunga tak noni ngei. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Ma anghan nangni rang khom nin samsang tena khom tellet kêng ani. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Masikin chi no roi; invâ tamtakngei nêkin nin lût uol ok kêng!<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista thop le heng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>“Tutu loko rieta ni thop kai chu kei khom invâna ka pa makunga thop ki tih. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Aniatachu tutu loko rieta ni heng kai chu invâna ka Pa makunga heng ki tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:12">2 Tim 2:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inngêina niloiin, khandai minlêng rang roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>“Rammuola hin inngêina minlêng ranga juongin mi mindon no roi. Inngêina minlêng ranga juong ni mu unga, khandai minlêng ranga juong kêng ki ni. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Nâipasalngeiin an pangei mindoi rang, nâinupangngeiin an nungei mindoi rang, moi ngeiin an tarpingei mindoi ranga juong kêng ki ni;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35-36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mic 7:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>na râl saloitakngei chu ni insûng mingei nanâk nîng an tih.<verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>“Tutu keima nêka an nungei mo, an pangei mo lungkham uol ngei chu ku ruoisi rangin chuk mak ngei; tutu keima nêka an nâipasalngei mo, an nâinupangngei mo lungkham uol ngei chu ka ruoisi rangin chuk mak ngei. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Tutu an khros ruputa ku nûk jûiloi ngei chu ku ruoisi rangin chuk mak ngei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Mat 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mk 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk 9:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Tutu an ringna man rang bôk ngei kaiin chu machân an ta; aniatachu, keima rang sika an ringna machân ngei kaiin chu man uol an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Mat 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Joh 12:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Râisânmanngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mk 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>“Tukhom nangni modôm chu keima ni modôm ani, tukhom keima ni pom chu mitîrpu a pom ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Joh 13:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Tukhom Pathien tîrlam hah Pathien tîrlam anina sikin a lei modômin chu Pathien tîrlam, râisânman chang sâng a tih. Tukhom misa hah misa anina sikin a lei pomin chu misa râisânman chang sâng a tih. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Tukhom ku nûkjûi ngei lâia a chîntak khom ka ruoisi anina sikin tuidâi kilât khat khom lei min nêk chu, nangni ki ril, râisânman chu man ngêt a tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Baptispu John renga tîrlamngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Jisua'n hi rilnangei hih a ruoisi sômleinik ngei kôm a pêk suolechu, ma mun hah a mâka, male a revêla khopuingeia minchu rang le thurchi misîr rangin a se zoia.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Baptispu John'n Jisua sintho ngei hah jêl ina a lei rietin chu, a ruoisingei senkhat Jisua kôm a tîra. <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>Jisua kôm han, “Ni ril roh, ‘John'n a juong rangpu a ti hah nini mo?’ Aninônchu mi dang kin la sabei rang mo?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Se nôk ungla, neinun nin mu le nin riet ngei hih John kôm va ril roi: <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>mitcho ngeiin an mu thei zoi, kholrangeiin an lôn thei zoi, vun ri saloitak ngei minthieng ani zoi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">minthieng: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">8:2 en roh.</char></note> kuorsêtngei khom an riet thei zoi, athi ngei minring nôk ani zoi, inriengngei kôm Thurchi Sa misîr ani zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Tutu ku chungroia mulungokchâna neiloi ngei chu satvur an ni!” tiin a ani thuon ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>John ruoisingei hah an se nôkin chu, Jisu a'n lokongei kôm han John chungroi a misîra: “John kôm ramchâra nin se lâihan imo mu rangin nin sabei ha? Phâivuo'n sûlngei asêm minkûm hah mo? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Imo en rangin nin se? Mi puon innêmngei leh invo mo? Ma anga ânvo ngâi mingei chu rêng-ina kêng an om ngâi! <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Ni ril roi, imo en rangin nin se? Dêipu mo? Ani tatak, aniatachu, dêipu nêka lien uol ok nin mu hi te. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>John chungroi rang hi kêng Pathien Lekhabu'n, ‘Pathien'n ki tîrlam no motona na lampui mo-ong rangin tîr ki tih,’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char></note> a lei ti hah ani. <verse eid="MAT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Adiktakin nangni ki ti, Baptispu John nêka lien uol tute lân zir ngâi mak ngei. Hannirese, invân Rêngrama a chintakpu khom John nêkin chu alien uol ani. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Baptispu John'n a thurchi a misîr lâi renga aviensûn tena invân Rêngram chu rangrâta doina ngei atuong ngâia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">rangrâta doina ngei atuong ngâia; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">rangrâtin hong omin.</char></note> mi tukdullien ngeiin ma ram hah lâk rang an pût ngâi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:16">Luk 16:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Dêipungei murdi le Moses Balam chong han John juong om dênin, Rêngram Thurchi an misîra; <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>an thurchi misîr nin iem nuomin chu, a juong rang chongphuonga lei om chu, John hih Elijah ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">Mat 17:10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11-13">Mk 9:11-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Hanchu, kuor nin dônin chu rangai roi!<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>“Atûn lâia thoitharngei hih ile mo ki mintêk rang? Nâipangngei bazar muna insungngei angin an ni, pâl khatin pâl dangngei an mi-ieaka, <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‘Inneina miringhoi nangni kin tum pea, aniatachu, lâm mak cheia! Chûlna la kin tho khomin chap mak chei!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>John a juong lâihan bu a ngêia, uain nêk maka, mitinin, ‘Ama chu ramkhori sûr kêng an tia!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Miriem Nâipasal chu a juonga, a sâka, a nêka, mitinin, ‘Hi mi hih en ta u! Bu mudupa le uain mudupa, sum rusuongngei leh midikloi ngei malpa so!’ an tia. Nikhomrese, Pathien vârna chu adik iti a mara han minlangin aom ani,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">A iemloi khopuingei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Jisua'n sininkhêl a thona khopuingeia mingei han an nunsienangei renga inhei mak ngeia, masikin ha khopuingei hah a ngo ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>“Korazin, nu chungroi arik bah na! Bethsaida, khom nu chungroi arik bah na! Nangnia sininkhêl sina omngei hah Tyre le Sidon'a lei sin nisenla chu, ma taka mingei han an nunsiena ngei renga an inhei minlangnân thoilapuon insilin ruvuta an inbuolna sôt atih zoi!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Ezek 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joel 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amos 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zak 9:2-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Adiktakin nangni ki ril, Roijêk Nikhuon chu Pathien'n nangni nêkin chu Tyre le Sidon mingei chunga mulungjûrpuina minlang uol atih! <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Nangma, Capernaum rang khom! nangma nethenin invân dênin indomsâng rang nu nuom mini? Meidîla vôrpai nîng ni tih! Nu sûnga sininkhêl sina omngei hah Sodom'a lei sin nisenla chu aviensûn tena hin la om tit atih!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa 14:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Aph 19:24-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Nang ki ril, Roijêk Nikhuon chu Pathien'n nangma nêkin chu Sodom chunga mulungjûrpuina minlang uol atih!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luk 10:12</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ko kôm hong ungla inngam roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Ma zora lâihan Jisua'n, “Pa, invân le pilchung Pumapa! mivâr, mitheingei kôma ni ip hah mi inmôlngei kôm ni minlang sikin no kôm râisânchong ki ril. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Ani, Pa, ma anga hongni rang hah nu lungdo tak ani.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>“Neinunngei murdi ka Pa'n ni pêk zoi. Pa tiloiin chu tutên Nâipasal hah riet mak ngei, male Nâipasal tiloiin chu tutên Pa khom riet mak ngei, Nâipasalin ân phuongna ranga a thang ngeia tiloiin chu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Joh 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">1:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>“Nangni, puok rik pêla sôlngei, nin rêngin ko kôm hong ungla, keima'n inngamna nangni pêk ki tih. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Ki ringkol lâk ungla pêl roi, male ko kôm inchû roi, ratha han nuninnêm tak le rangâiinchîn tak ki ni sikin; inngamna man nin tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Jer 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Ki ringkol nangni ke pêk rang chu apêl ahoia, ku puok khom ajânghiei ani,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Sabbathni chungroia chongrekel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mk 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Sûn sôtbâkloi suolechu Sabbathnin Jisua bubilngeia a lôna. A ruoisingei an von achâma, masikin buvûingei chinin an chipa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Bal 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Phariseengeiin an mu'n chu, Jisua kôm, “En ta, Sabbathnia nu ruoisingeiin an tho hih ei Balamin ai khap ani!” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “David le a mingeiin an vonchâm lâia an tho hah nin la pore tet ngâiloi mo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3,4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Ama hah Pathien ina a lûta, ama le a mingeiin Pathien kôma pêksai vâipôl, an sâk ranga Balamin ai khap ochaingei vaiin an sâk ranga phala omngâi vâipôl hah an sâk ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Och 24:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Aninônchu, adiktakin Sabbathni racham ochai Biekina omngâi ngeiin Sabbathni balam an minchâi ngâia, hannoma, theiloiintum<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9-10">Tel 28:9-10</ref></char></note> ngâi mak ngei ti Moses Balam lekhabu nin la pore loi mo? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Nangni ki ril, mahin neinun imini Biekin nêka roiinpui uol aom. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Pathien lekhabu'n, ‘Inbôlna nuom mu-unga moroina kêng ku nuom,’ ai ti hih a omtie nin riet minthâr tatak nisenla chu minchâinaboi mingei hah theiloi mintum no tunui;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mat 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Miriem Nâipasal hih Sabbathni Pumapa ani sikin,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n pasal kut kângkhat phalkhatthi a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mk 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Jisua'n ha mun hah mâkin synagog ina a lûta, <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>mahan mi inkhat kut phalkhatthi alei oma. Mi senkhat Jisua a tho minchâi tia nôn nuom ngei an lei om sa, masikin anni han a kôm, “Sabbathnia mi mindam hih ei Balamin a khap mo?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Nin lâia tumakhatin belri inkhat dôn senla male Sabbathni han khur inthûka tâk pe senla, juong rûtin nin kelsuo loi rang mo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:5">Luk 14:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Miriem chu belri nêkin a lut uol ok ani! Masikin, Sabbathnia tumini san rangin ei Balamin mi phal ani,” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Male kut phalkhatthipa kôm han, “Nu kut phar roh,” a tipea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">A kut a phara, kângkhat tienga angin a hong dam phar zoi. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Hanchu Phariseengei hah an rota male Jisua that rangtie an mintuo zoi.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien tîrlâm thang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>An that rangtie an phan chungroi hah Jisua'n a rietin chu ha mun renga hah a rota; lokongeiin a nûk an jûi zoi. Damloi ngei murdi a mindam ngeia <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>male ama chungroi tute kôm misîr loi rangin chong a pêk ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Masikin, Pathien'n dêipu Isaiah kôma alei ti hah ajuong tung adik theina rangin mahi a tho ani:<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Mahi ki tîrlâm, ka thangsaipu hah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18-21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Isa 42:1-4</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">ku lungkhampu, le a chunga ku mulungtâiriempu hah ani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">A chunga ka ratha tîr ka ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">male ama'n namtinngei kôm ko roijêkna phuong a tih.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Ama chu makhal nonia, hanchu in-iek uol nonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">aninônchu lamlienngeia khom ruhulum tho noni.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Ama'n sûl ânkûichara om hah khiekpai nonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">hanchu châti athi vavâng hah khom thatrip no nih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Roijêkdikna han a zoi mâka chu khan tit a ta,<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>male mingei murdi'n ama chunga han an sabeina minngam an tih.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua le Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mk 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Hanchu mi senkhat ngeiin Jisua kôm han mi inkhat a mitcho le ramkhori sûr sikin chong theiloi an hong tuonga. Jisua'n ama hah a mindama, masikin ama hah a chong theia, a mu thei zoi ani. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Jisua sintho hah lokongei murdi'n an kamâm sabaka, “Ama hih David Nâipasal ni thei ni mo?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Maha Phariseengeiin an rietin chu, “Hi mi hin ramkhoringei a rujûl theina chu an rêngpa Beelzebul'n ranak a pêk sikin ani,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note> tiin chong an mele.<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Jisua'n imo an mindon hah a rieta, masikin an kôm, “Kho ram khom apâlpâlin an insema an indoi inlômin chu sôi ngâi mak. Kho khopui khom, aninônchu insûngmingei khom apâlpâlin an insenna an indoi inlômin chu an inlet rang ani. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Masikin soitan rama khom pâl khatin pâl dang an doiin chu, pâl an insen tina nîng ata, male ânlet kelen rang ani! <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Beelzebul'n ranak ni pêk sikin ramkhori ngei ku rujûl thei nin tia. Asa, nônchu, nin nûkjûi ngei hah tumo ranak a pêk ngeia anni ngei han an rujûlpai ngâi? Nin nûkjûingei nanâkin an lei tho ngâi han nin tho minchâina a minlang ani! <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Nimak, mahi Beelzebul nimaka, Pathien Ratha kêng ramkhori rujûlpai theina ranak ni pêk, mahin Pathien Rêngram nin kôm a juong tung zoi ti a minlang ani.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>“Tutên mi rât ina lûtin a neinunngei lâk pe thei no nih, mi rât hah a khit bak nônchu; hanchu a in hah minram pe thei a tih.<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>“Tutu keima ranga niloi kai chu atatakin mi doi ani; tutu a mintûp ni sanloipu chu ataktakin chekaminchâi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mk 9:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Masikin nangni ki ril, mingei an sietna murdi le Pathien doia asaloi an ti ngei murdi chu ngâidam thei nîng ata;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">asaloi an ti ngei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathien doia asaloi an ti ngei.</char></note> aniatachu, Ratha Inthieng doia asaloi an ti ngei chu ngâidam nino nih. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Tutu Miriem Nâipasal doia asaloi an ti ngei chu ngâidam thei nîng ata; aniatachu, tutu Ratha Inthieng doia asaloi an ti ngei chu atûn le tuonsôtin ngâidam nino nih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thingkung le amara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>“Mara sa dôn rangin chu thingkung adam nin dôn ngêt anâng; thingkung damloi nin dônin chu mara saloi dôn nin tih. Thingkung chu a marân riet thei ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:20">Mat 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:44">Luk 6:44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Murûlngei nangni asaloi lei ni chienin kho-angin mo chongsa nin tho thei ranga? Mulung sûnga sipa liem hah kêng bâiin ai suo ngâi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:45">6:45</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Mi sân a rochonkok renga neinun sa a kaisuo ngâia; mi saloiin chu a rochonkoka neinun saloi a kaisuo ngâi.<verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>“Nangni ki ril, Roijêk Nikhuon chu mitinin chongkâmboi an tho ngei hah la misîr let an tih. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Minchâinaboi mo ni ni aninônchu theiloiintum mo ni ni minthârna rangin no chongngei hah mangin nu chungroi jêk nîng atih.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sininkhêl tho rang an zong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mk 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Hanchu Balam minchupu senkhat le Pharisee senkhat ngeiin a kôm, “Minchupu, sininkhêl no tho mu rang kin nuom,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:1">Mat 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mk 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11:16</ref></char></note> an tia.<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Jisua jâminzalin an kôm, “Atûnlâia mingei idôrtaka saloi le Pathien dônloi mo nin ni zoi!” Sininkhêl tho rangin mi nin ngêna? Nimak! Dêipu Jonah sininkhêl tho tiloiin chu sininkhêl dang nangni pêk ni no nih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Jonah hah sûnthum jân thum ngapui vonsûnga a oma, ma angdên han Miriem Nâipasal hih sûnthum jân thum pil inthûk sûnga aom rang ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:17">Jon 1:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Roijêk Nikhuon chu Nineveh mingei hah inding an ta, nangni nôn an tih; anni chu Jonah thurchi misîr an rieta; an sietnangei renga an inhei sikin; male nangni ki ril, Jonah nêka lien uol mahin aom!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Jon 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Roijêk Nikhuon chu Rêngnu Sheba hah inding a ta, nangni nôn a tih, Rêng Solomon vâr minchûna rangâi rangin a ram latak renga a hong sikin; adiktakin nangni ki ril, Solomon nêka lien uol mahin aom!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Rêng 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Rich 9:1-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ratha saloi hongkîr nôk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>“Ratha saloi hah mi sûng renga a jôkin chu inngâmna mun rokin tui boina rama a chai titira, aman loi tika chu, <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>‘ki ina kîr nôk ki tih’ a tia. Hanchu a kîr nôka, a in atongrieiin, phiet minsâivarin, le cherêl irin ava mua. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Hanchu, a jôkpaia ratha dang sari ama nêka puoloi uol a hong tuong ngeia, mahan an lûta, an om zoi. Masuole chu ha miriem nunchan hah aphuta nêkin a puoloi uol ok zoi. Hima ang hin atûnlâia mi saloi ngei chunga ala tung rang ani,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua nû le lâibungngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mk 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Mipui ngei kôm han Jisua ala chong lâitakin, a nû le lâibungngei an hong tunga. Ama chongpui nuomin, pêntieng an indinga. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Masikin ha muna mi inkhatin a kôm, “En ta, nu nû le na lâibungngei nang chongpui rang an nuoma pêntieng nang an ngâk,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:47: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhatngei chu arachang 47 hi dôn mak ngei.</char></note> a ti pea.<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Tumo ku nû? Tumo ka lâibungngei?” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Male a ruoisingei tieng a khînna, “En roi! Hi ngei hih ku nû le ka lâibungngei an ni! <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Tutu invâna Ka Pa lungdo sinngei hih ka lâibungngei, ka sarnungei, ku nû ngei an ni,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Sachirethepa chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mk 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Mani sûn nanâk han Jisua hah in mâkin dîl rakham tieng a sea, mahan minchu rangin ânsunga. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Loko ahong intûp hah an tamrai sikin rukuonga ânsunga, loko ngei chu dîl rakhama an indinga.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Chongmintêkngei mangin neinun tamtak a misîr pe ngei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Rangai ta u, voikhat chu mi inkhatin burît rangin a sea. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Loilâia sachi a rethea, senkhat lampui kôla achula, vâ ngei an honga an sâkripa. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Senkhat lungpherpha chunga pil inphânna achula, pil abitloi sikin a hongkei kelena. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Aniatachu nisa ahôn sânga, alumin bukung innoinarte hah a em minthêma, aruzung mathâk hah ânthûkpe loi sikin achârrip zoi. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Sachi senkhatngei chu riling râng kâra achula, riling hah ahong insôna, adîp min mang riei zoi. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Aniatachu, senkhat chu pil sana achula, senkhat razan, senkhat sômrukin, senkhat sômthumin ahong inra zoi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Male Jisua'n chongkhârnan an kôm, “Kuor nin dônin chu rangâi roi!” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chongmintêkngei neinunkhîn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Hanchu ruoisingei hah Jisua kôm an honga, mipui ngei kôm thurchi ni misîrin “Ithomo chongmintêk na mang ngâia?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Invân Rêngram chonginthup roia rietna chu nin kôm pêk ani zoia, midang ngei kôm chu pêk nimak. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Tukhom neinun imini a dônsai kai chu pêk sa nîng ata, masikin ahundôr nêka tam dôn a tih; hannirese tukhom neinun ite dônloi chu a dônsai te hah khom lâk pe rip nîng a tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">19:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>An kôm chongmintêk manga ko chongpui ngei ngâina abitak chu an ena an mu loina rang, le an rangâia, aniatachu an rietthei loina ranga ani. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Masikin dêipu Isaiah lei ril hah an chunga ahong tung ani:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6:9-10</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Hi mingei hin rangâi an ta aniatachu rietthei noni ngei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">en, en an ta aniatachu mu thei noni ngeia,<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>an mulungngei alên môl zoia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">an kuorngei an lei min sêt zoia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">male an mitngei khom an lei sîng zoi sikin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Ninosenla, chu an mitin mûng an ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">an kuorin riet an ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">an mulungbôk ngeiin rietthei an ta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Pathien'n, ko kôm an hon heia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ke lei mindam ngei duoi mo tâk,’ a tia.<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>“Nangni rangin, idôra satvur mo nin ni zoi! Nin mitin a mua, nin kuorin a riet ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:23-24">Luk 10:23-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Adiktakin nangni ki ril, nin mu hih dêipu tamtakngei le Pathien mi tam takngei mu rang an nuom sabaka, aniatachu mu thei mak ngei, nin riet khom hih a riet an nuom sabaka, hannirese riet thei mak ngei ani.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n sachirethepa chongmintêk a rilminthâr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mk 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>“Hanchu, rangâi ungla, sachirethepa chongmintêk omtie hih inchu roi. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Tutu khom Rêngram thurchi rieta, aniatachu rietminthârna dônloi chu sachi lampui kôla chul angin an ni. Misie hah a honga, an mulungrîla rethea om hah a lâkpai pe ngei ngâi. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Sachi lungpherpha chunga pil inphânna chul chu thurchi hah a riet lehan râisântaka pom kelen ngei hih an ni. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Aniatachu ruzung inthûk amathâk loi sikin om sôt ngâi maka; ma thurchi sikin imokhat intakna mini nuomlona mini ahong om tena chu an mâk nôk kelen ngâi. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Sachi, riling râng kâra chul chu thurchi lei rietsai ngei an ni; hannirese hi taksa ringnuna hoina le nei rang nuomna roia kangdôina ngeiin chongtak hah adîpa, mara dôn ngâi mak ngei. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Hanchu sachi pil sana chul chu thurchi hah an rieta, male a rietthei ngei hah an ni. An mara ngei senkhat razan, senkhat sômrukin, senkhat sômthumin an hong pung ngâi,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bu rotholngei chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Jisua'n chongmintêk dang a rilngei nôka: “Invân Rêngram chu ma ang hin ani. Mi inkhatin a loia sachi sa rethepa leh mintêk ani. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Jân khat chu mi an inriei suole, a râl ahonga, bu lâia han bu rothol arthea, a rotpat nôka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Hanchu bu hah a hong mônga, ahong vuiin chu bu rothol khom ahong inlang sa zoi. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Loi pumapa tîrlâmngei hah an honga, a kôm, ‘Pu, no loia sachi sa nerthe hah; bu rothol so kho renga hong om mini?’ an tia. <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>Ama'n an kôm, ‘mahah chu râlngei lei tho kêng,’ tiin a thuona. Anni han, ‘bu rotholngei so va chuon unglang nu nuom mo?’ tiin an rekela. <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>‘Nâng mak,’ bu rothol nin chuonin chu butak khom nin phôidelsa rang kêng tiin a thuon ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Bu ât zora dên mâka chu butak le arothol anruonin munkhatin insôn rese ngei. Hanchu bu ât ngâingei kôm bu arothol hah phoipaia, khita, hâl baka masuole butak hah ka sasiera thun rangin chong la be ta rong a tia.”<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ancham ru chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mk 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Jisua'n chongmintêk dang a misîr pe ngei nôka, “Invân Rêngram chu min ancham ru a chôia, a loia a rethe ang hi ani. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Mahi chimuru murdi lâia a chîntak ani, aniatachu, ahong lien tikin chu chimu dang ngei nêka alientak ani ngâi. Thingkung ahong changa, masikin vâ ngei an honga, amachanga han rubu an phan ngâi,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chol chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Jisua'n chongmintêk dang a misîr nôka: “Invân Rêngram chu nuvengte inkhatin chol a lâka vâipôl her sômminli leh athoi mâka tâidôna a minpola a bil angin ani,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua chongmintêk a mangna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mk 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Ha ngei murdi hah Jisua'n lokongei kôm chongmintêkin a ril ngeia; chongmintêk mang loiin chu an kôm han ite misîr mak. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Mahi a thona bi chu dêipu'n alei misîr:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Lap 78:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“An kôm chong ki rillin chongmintêk mang ka ta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Khuonsieng renga neinun inthupngei hah misîr pe ngei ki tih,” ti hah ahong tung adikna ranga ani.<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n bu rotholngei chongmintêk a rilminthâr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Jisua'n lokongei hah mâkin insûnga a lûtin chu a ruoisingei an honga, a kôm, “Loia bu rothol chongmintêk roi hah khoi tina mo mi ril roh,” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Mi sachi sa rethepu hah Miriem Nâipasal ania; <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>loi chu rammuol hih ani; Sachi sa chu Rêngram nâingei hih an ni, bu rothol chu Misie nâingei an ni; <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>male râl, bu rothol rethepu hah chu Diabol ani. Bu ât zora chu rammuol mongna rang nikhuo ania, bu âtpu ngei hah vântîrtonngei an ni. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Bu rotholngei hah an mintûpa, meia an hâl angdên han rammuol mong tika chu ala tung rang ani: <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Miriem Nâipasal'n a vântîrtonngei hah tîr a ta, a Rêngram renga mi sietna sin ngâi ngei le saloi sin ngâi ngei chu minchun an ta, <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>mei thithei ngâiloia han pai ngei an ta, mahan chap an ta, an rakam riel an tih. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Hanchu Pathien mingei chu an Pa Rêngrama nisa angin vâr an tih zoi. Rangâi roi, kuor nin dônnin chu!<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rochon inthup chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>“Invân Rêngram chu mi inkhatin loilâia rochon phûm inrûkten amu suoka; a phûm nôka, a râisân rai sikin a sea, a dônngei murdi ava juor leta, a kîr nôka male ma loi hah a rochôk angin ani.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lungmantam chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>“Invân Rêngram chu mi inkhatin lungmantam satak a roka, <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>lungmantam satak hah a mûn chu, a sea, a dônngei murdi ava juor leta, male ma lungmantam hah a rochôk angin ani.<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lên chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>“Invân Rêngram chu ngasûrpu senkhat ngeiin an lên dîla an vôra, nga jât da-dang an sûr angin ani nôk. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Lên hah asipmat tena chu dîl rakhama an kaisuoa, mahan nga insem rangin an insunga: asa murdi chu koka an thuna asaloi kai chu an paia. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Rammuol mong tika chu ma anghan la nîng atih: vântîrtonngei juong suok an ta, misangei lâi renga misaloingei hah mintûp an ta <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>mei thithei ngâiloia han pai an ta, mahan chap an ta, an hâ riel an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chongtak athar le amuruo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Ma neinungei murdi hah nin rietthei mo?” tiin a rekel ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">“O, kin rietthei,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Ama'n an kôm, “Ma omtie chu, Balam minchupungei murdi invân Rêngrama ruoisi changngei kai chu, in pumapa a rochondarna khâltan renga neinun thar le neinun muruo a kaisuo angin ani,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nazareth a Jisua hengin aom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mk 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-39">Luk 4:16-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Jisua'n ma chongmintêkngei hah a misîr suolechu ma mun hah a mâka, <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>a omna ngâi khopui tieng a kîr nôka. synagog ina a minchua, a thurchi misîr ariet murdi'n chu an kamâm sabaka, “Hima anga vârna hih kho renga a man mo?” male “Sininkhêl sintheina hih kho renga a man mo?” tiin an rekela. <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>“Hi mi hih thing kutthiempu nâipasal hah nimak mo? Mary hah a nu nimak mo? A lâibungngei khom, Jacob, Joseph, Simon le Judas ngei nimak mo? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>A sarnungei khom hitaka om nimak ngei mo? Kho renga mo hi ngei murdi hih a man?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Male ama hah an heng zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:57: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Joh 4:44</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Jisua'n an kôm, “Dêipu chu a khopui sûnga le a insûngmingei lâia tiloiin chu muntina an mirit ngâi,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Taksônna an dônloi sikin ma mun han chu sininkhêl sin mintam ok mak ani.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Baptispu John thina roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mk 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Ma zora han Galilee rama, rêng Herod'n Jisua chungroi a lei rieta. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>A sinthopu ulienngei kôm han, “Hi mi hih Baptispu John, a hong ring nôk ngêt ani rang.” “Masikin kêng hi sininkhêl sintheina ranak hih a dôn,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Motona han Herod'n John hah a lei minsûra, a khita jêl-ina alei khum ani. Ma anga a thona bitak chu a lâibungpa Philip lômnu Herodias sika ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk 3:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Baptispu John han Herod kôm, “Herodias lômnua ne nei hih dik mak!” a lei tipea.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Och 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Herod'n ama hah that rang a jôta, aniatachu Juda mipui ngei a chi ani, John hah Dêipu'n an lei be sikin.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Herod suokni han Herodias nâinupang hah mipui ngei makunga a lâma. Herod hah a râisân tataka <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>a kôm han chonginkhâmin, “Ikhom no zong kai chu nang pêk rangin chong kên khâm!” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Hanchu a nû'n a tipe lam angin, “Hi muna hin atûn mâirânga Baptispu John lu mi pêk roh!” tiin Herod kôm han a ngêna.<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Rêngpa han a mulungdûk atong sabak zoia, nikhomrese, a khuolmi ngei makunga chong a lênkhâm zoi sikin, a ngên lam anghan tho pe rangin chong a pêk ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Hanchu jêl-ina han John lu hah a min tan ngei zoi. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>A lu hah mâirânga an hong chôia, nupangte kôm an pêka, amanu han a nû kôm a chôi zoi. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>John ruoisingei an honga, a ruok hah an chôia, an phûm zoi; hanchu an sea, Jisua an va misîr pe zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mi isâng rangnga a vâina roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joh 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Jisua'n John chungroi a rietin chu, ma mun hah a mâka, rukuongin a theivaiin mun inthimngangna a se zoi. Ma roi hah mipuingeiin an rieta, masikin an khopuingei ha mâkin ama omna tâng tieng an jûia. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Jisua rukuong renga a jôka, mipui ngei hah a mu'n chu inrieng amu ngei tataka, male damloi ngei hah a mindama.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Mani kholoi han a ruoisingei an honga a kôm, “Nisa laka ase ok zoia, mahi mun inthimngang kêng ani; Mipui ngei hih tîrpai ngei inla, khosûngngeia se rese ngei, anthenin sâk rang rochôk rese ngei,” an ti pea.<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “An se rang nâng maka, nangnin an sâk rang imakhat pêk ngei roi!” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Anni han a kôm, “Hitaka kin dôn chu anrêngin vâipôl rangnga le nga inik vai kêng,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Hanchu Jisua'n, “Hin ko kôm hong chôi roi,” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Mipui ngei hah durba chunga insung rangin chong a pêk ngeia; hanchu, vâipôl rangnga le nga inik hah a lâka, invân tieng tangin Pathien kôm râisânchong a rila. Vâipôlngei hah a khoia, ruoisingei kôm a pêka, male ruoisingei han mipui ngei kôm an sem zoia. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Mi murdi'n an sâka, an khoptanga, an sâk minieng tabong sômleinik an la rût minsipa. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Asâkngei mijôn chu nupangngei le nâipangngei telloiin mi isâng rangnga dôr an ni.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua tui chunga a lôn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mk 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Joh 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Male Jisua'n mipui ngei hah a minchînna, a ruoisingei rukuonga a min chuong ngeia, dîl râl kângkhat tieng alei min se ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Mipui ngei a min se ngei suolechu a thenin tâng chunga chubaitho rangin a sea. Kholoi a hongnin chu, mahan Jisua atheivaiin a oma; <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>ma zora han rukuong hah dîla alazanna a om zoia, phâivuo'n ale tieng asêm sikin, tuidârinsokin kângkhat tieng khom, kângkhat tieng khom a soka.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Jînga dâr thum le dâr ruk kongkâra Jisua tui chunga lônnin, a ruoisingei kôm a honga. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Tui chunga a hong lôn an mûn chu an chia. “Mirluoi kêng!” tiin, ichin an iniek rarâka.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Jisua'n a hong rokôkngei kelena, “Nin rathamathâk no roi!” chi no roi, “Keima kêng ki ni!” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Hanchu Peter a hong chonga. “Pumapa, nangma ni ni tatakin chu, tui chunga no kôm hong rangin chong ni pêk roh,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Jisua'n, “Hong roh!” tiin a thuona. Masikin Peter hah rukuong renga a jôka, Jisua kôm panin tui chunga a lôn phut zoia. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Hannirese, phâivuo rât hah a mûn chu a chia, tuia a ngim phut zoi. “Pumapa, ni mojôk roh!” tiin a chapa.<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Jisua a hong tung kelena male a muturap kelen zoia, a kôm, “Na taksônna dôn hah achîn bâkna! Ithomo ni iem zoi loi?” a tipea.<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>An ruonin rukuong sûnga an lûta, phâivuo khom ânthim ruoi zoi. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Male rukuong sûnga ruoisingei han Jisua chubai an mûk zoi. “Pathien Nâipasal tatak kêng ni ni!” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Gennesaret'a damloi ngei a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mk 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Dîl râl tieng an inkânin chu Genesaret ram an hong tunga, <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Ma taka mingei han Jisua hah an lei riet kelena. Masikin ma revêla ram murdia han mi an tîra, damloi murdi hah Jisua kôm an hong tuonga. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Damloi ngei hah a puon morte luo mintôn ngei rangin an ngêna; male a tôn murdi chu an dam pak zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Pipungei chongmâk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mk 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Hanchu Jerusalem renga pharisee le Balam minchupungei senkhat Jisua kôm an honga male a kôm. <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Ithomo nu ruoisingeiin ei pipungei chongmâk ngei hih an jôm ngâiloi? Sâk an sâk rang khomin balam angin an kut rusûk ngâi mak ngei!” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Ithomo Pathien chongpêk jômloiin nin theia chongmâk nin jûi hih? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Pathien'n, ‘Nu nû le na pa mirit tho roh,’ male ‘Tukhom a nû mo, a pa mo, khomâksâm chu that rang ani,’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Jôk 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Bal 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Och 20:9</ref></char></note> a ti ani. <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Hannirese, nangnin chu tutu a nu mo, a pa mo, sanna rang imini neinun a dôna, aniatachu, ‘Mahi Pathien ta kêng ani zoi a tiin chu,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>a nû mo, a pa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a pa; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhatngeiin an dôn</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">a pa mo a nu mo.</char></note> mo mirit a tho rang nâng khâi mak nin ti ngâia. Ma ang han, nin chongmâk nin jôm theina rangin Pathien chongpêk chu itên nin be ngâiloi ani. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Nangni asarotholngei! Isaiah'n nin chungroi alei misîr hah adik bâkna!”:<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>“Hi mingei hin an chongbâiin min mirita,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa 29:13</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">aniatachu an mulungrîl chu adiktakin kei renga alazan.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>An miriem minchuna balamngei hah ka balamngei anghan an be sikin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">min biekna hih anni rangin kamnângloi kêng ani, Pathien'n a ti!” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miriem minnim ngâi neinunngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mk 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Hanchu Jisua'n lokongei hah a kôm a koi ngeia, an kôm, “Rangâi ungla, rietthei roi! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Mi bâia lût han a minnim ngâi ni maka; manêkin chu a bâi renga hong suok han kêng a minnim ngâi,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Male a ruoisingei an honga, a kôm, “No chong han Phariseengei mulung amophop ti ni riet mo?” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Jisua'n, “Kung murdi invâna ka Pa phun niloi chu phôipaiin om an tih,” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>“An chungroia nin kângmindoi no roi! Anni ngei hah mitcho ngei ruoipu mitcho an nia; mitcho hah mitcho nanâkin a kairuoiin chu an ruonin khura tâk an tih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Luk 6:39</ref></char></note> tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Peter a chonga, “Ma chong omtie hih mi rilminthâr pe roh,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Midangngei nêkin atûnten la vâr uol mak chei. <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Nin rietthei loi mo ani? I neinun khom miriem bâia lût murdi chu a phûnga a lûta, masuole chu a nômsena ajôkpai ngâi ani. <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Aniatachu neinunngei bâi renga hong suok chu mulungrîl renga hong suok ania, ma neinunngei hah kêng miriem minnim ngâi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>A mulungrîl renga mindonna saloi ngei ahong suoka, mangei han kêng a ruoia mi thatnangei, inrênangei, hur inditnangei, inrunangei, mi huongnangei le adikloi teta midang êronangei a musuok ngâi ani. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Hi neinunngei hih, miriem minnim ngâi chu ani. Aniatachu an ti anghan nin kutngei rusûk loia sâknêk nin sâk hin chu miriem minnim ngâi mak,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuvengtenu taksônna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mk 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Jisua'n ha mun hah mâkin Tyre le Sidon khopuilienngei kôla ramhuol revêla a sea. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Ha rama om Canaan nuvengte inkhat a kôm a honga, “David Nâipasal! Inrieng ni mu roh, pu! Ka nâinupang ramkhori'n a sûra, changrangintak sabakin aom ani,” tiin ânieka. <verse eid="MAT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Hannirese, Jisua'n chongbâi khat luon thuon mak. A ruoisingei a kôm an honga, “Hi nu hih tîrpai ta roh! Ei nûk mi jûia, michok chuchur!” tiin an ngêna.<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Male Jisua'n, “Israel mingei lâia belri inmangngei kôm vai kêng tîr ki ni,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Ha chong hah nuvengtenu han a rietin chu a honga, a ke bula an boka. “Pu, ni san roh!” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Jisua'n, “Nâingei vâipôl lâk pea uingei kôma pêk chu dik mak,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Nuvengtenu han a kôm, “Pu, maha chu adik, aniatachu uingei khomin an pungei dosâng nuoia vâipôl hâr atâk chu an sâk ngâi mo ka ta,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Masikin Jisua'n a kôm, “Nuvengtenu taksônna lientak dôn ni ni! Nu nuom tak hah na ta rangin sinin om a tih,” a tipea. Male a nâinupang hah ma zoratak han a hong dam pe zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mi tamtak a mindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Jisua'n ha mun renga hah a sea, Galilee dîl kôla a lôna. Tânga a kala male ân sung zoi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Mipui tamtak a kôm an honga, kholra, mitcho, achôp, chongtheiloi le damloi dang tamtak Jisua ke bula an hong tuonga; a lei mindam ngei leta. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Mipui ngei han chongtheiloi hong chong, ân-ûng a hong dam, kholra hong lônthei le mitcho hong muthei ngei hah an mûn chu an kamâm sabaka, hanchu Israel Pathien an minpâk zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mipui isâng minli a vâina roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mk 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Hanchu Jisua'n a ruoisingei a koia, an kôm, “Mipui ngei hih sûnthum ko kôm an om zoia, atûn hin ite sâk rang an dônloi sikin ku lungkham ngei tatak. Bungêiin tîrpai ngei rang nuom mu-ung, aninôn chu lampuia châmsôl invei an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Ruoisingei han a kôm, “Hi dôra mipui vâi minkhopna rangin hi ramchâra hin khonmo sâknêk ei man ranga?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Jisua'n, “Vâipôl idôrmo nin dôn?” tiin a rekela;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Anni han “Vâipôltâp sari” le “ngate atômte,” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Masikin Jisua'n mipui ngei hah nuoia insung rangin chong a pêka. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Male vâipôltâp sari le nga hah a lâka, Pathien kôm râisânchong rilin a khoia, ruoisingei kôm a pêka; male ruoisingei han mipui ngei kôm an pêka. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>An rêngin an sâka an khoppaka. Hanchu ruoisingei han an sâk minieng arnôi tabông sari an rût minsipa. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Asâkngei hah nupangngei le nâipangngei telloiin mi isâng minli an ni.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Masuole chu Jisua'n mipui ngei a tîrpai ngei suolechu rukuonga a chuonga, Magadan ramhuol tieng a se zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Sininkhêl sin rang an zong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mk 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Pharisee le Sadducee senkhatngei Jisua kôma hong ngeiin ama min-ôk rang an nuoma, masikin Pathien'n ama a pom, tih riet theina rangin sininkhêl thôn minlang rangin an ngêna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Nikhomrese, Jisua'n an kôm, “Nisa ahong tâkin chu, ‘kôlkung asen sikin khuo ahoi rang kêng nin ti ngâi.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Male jînga chu, ‘Kôl asena, invân ânnîm sikin ruo ajuong rang kêng,’ nin ti ngâi. Invân enin khuohoi rang le hoiloi rang nin leiphuong theia, aniatachu, atûnlâia minsinnangei hi chu minlen thei mak chei!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhatngei chu archang 2-3 taka Jisua chongbâingei hih dôn mak ngei.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Atûnlâi mingei hih idôrtaka saloi le pathienboi mo an ni zoi! Minsinna mi nin zong na? Nimak! Jonah minsinna hi vai kêng nin kôma minsinna nangni pêk rang chu ani zoi,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mat 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk 11:29</ref></char></note> tiin a thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Masikin a mâk ngeia male a rotpat zoi.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phariseengei le Sadduceengei chol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mk 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Ruoisingei hah dîl râl an rakânin chu, vâipôl chôi rang an hong mingila. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Singthei roi; Phariseengei le Sadduceengei chol renga indîn roi,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12:1</ref></char></note> a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Anni han, “Vâipôl ei hong chôi loi sika mahi a ti ani,” tiin an lâia an injêk phut zoi.<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Jisua'n an misîrngei hah a rieta, an kôm, “Ithomo nin vâipôl hong chôi loi roi hah nin lâia nangni nanâkin nin jêk bang? Idôra taksônna chîn dôn mo nin ni zoi! <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Nin la rietthei tet loi mini? Mi isâng rangnga ngei ta ranga vâipôltâp rangnga ko khoi lâia hah nin riet khâiloi mo? An sâk minieng tabong izetmo nin rût minsip ha?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:17-21">Mat 14:17-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Mi isâng minli ngei ranga vâipôltâp sari chungroi rek ha te? An sâk minieng tabong izetmo nin rût minsip ha?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:34-38">Mat 15:34-38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Nônte ithomo nin kôm vâipôl roi misîr mu-ung ti nin riet thei loi? Nangni nanâkin Phariseengei le Sadduceengei chol renga indîn roi!” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Male ruoisingei han vâipôla chol mang ngâi renga indîn rang ni loiin, Phariseengei le Sadduceengei minchuna renga indîn ranga inningna ani ti an riet thei zoi.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter'n Jisua chungroi a phuongna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mk 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Jisua hah Caesarea Philippi khopui kôla ramhuola a sea, mahan a ruoisingei kôm, “Miriem Nâipasal hih mingeiin tumo ani an ti?” tiin a rekel ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>“Senkhatin chu Baptispu John ani,” Adangngeiin chu “Elijah ani,” senkhat nôkin chu “Jeremiah aninônchu dêipu tumakhat mini, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mat 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char></note> nang an ti,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>“Nangnîn rêkte?” ama'n, “Tumo ki ni nin ti?” tiin a rekel ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simon Peter'n a kôm, “Messiah, Pathien ring Nâipasal hah ni ni,” tiin a thuona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Joh 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Simon John nâipasal, na ta rangin asa bâk na! Hi chongtak hih munisi renga no kôm ahong nimaka, invâna om ka Pa'n adiktakin nang a pêk ani. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Masikin Peter; lungpui ni ni, ti nang ki ril. Hi lungpui chunga hin ko koiindang minding ka ta, thina khomin mene no nih. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Invân Rêngram chabi nang pêk ka ta; pilchunga na khap kai chu invâna khom khap nîng a ta, pilchunga na phal kai chu invâna khom phal ani rang ani,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">Mat 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Joh 20:23</ref></char></note> a tipea.<verse eid="MAT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Male Messiah ani ti tute ril loi rangin ruoisingei hah chong a pêk ngei zoi.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua tuong rang le a thi rang roi a misîr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Ma zora renga chu Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôm ânthârlakin a misîr phut zoia, an kôm, “Jerusalema ke se ngêt rang ani, upangei, Ochaisingei le Balam minchupungei kuta tuong ok ki tih. Thatin om ka ta, nikhomrese, sûnthum suolechu aringin kaithoiin om ki tih,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Peter'n ama hah atheiin a tuonga, a kôm, “Pathien'n maha akhap, Pumapa!” ama'n, “Mahah nu chunga tung tet no nih!” tiin a ngoa.<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Jisua ânheia Peter kôm, “Soitan, ko kôm renga rotpai roh! ka lampui ni ni chakal, ni mindonngei hih Pathien renga hong suok ni maka, munisi nina renga ani sikin,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Male Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôm, “Tutu mi jûi a nuomin chu ama taksa rang mingilin a khros ruputin mi jûi rese.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Tukhom a ringna mojôk a nuom kaiin machân an ta; aniatachu, keima sika an ringna machân kaiin man an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Joh 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Mi'n rammuol hih apumin dôn senla, an ringna chu machân ta senla ngei, imo alâp an man ranga? Man noni ngei! An ringna man nôkna rangin ite pêk rang an dôn loi sikin. <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Miriem Nâipasal hih a Pa roiinpuinan invôn a vantîrtonngei leh a juong rang kêng ani zoi, ma tikin chu mitinin an sintho dungjûiin râisânman a pêk rang ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Lap 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Adiktakin nangni ki ril, hi taka om senkhatngei hih Miriem Nâipasal Rêng angin a juong an mu mâka chu thi loi rang an om,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Mêl inthûlna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mk 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Sûnruk suole chu Jisua'n Peter le a lâibungngei Jacob le John a tuong ngeia, an theivaiin muol insângna a se pui ngeia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Pet 1:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>An mit muchungin Jisua mêl a hong inthûla: a mâi nisa angin a hong vâra, a puonsilngei khom ântêrrakin ahong cheka. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Male ruoisingei inthum han Moses le Elijah ngeiin Jisua an chongpui an mua. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Hanchu Peter'n Jisua kôm, “Pumapa, hitaka om hih ei ta rangin idôra asa mo ni zoi! Nu nuomin chu puon-in inthum sin ka ta, nangma rang inkhat, Moses rang inkhat male Elijah rang inkhat,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Ala chonglâitakin, sûm vârin ajuong mukhu ngeia, sûmlâi renga rôl ajuon ringa, “Ama hih ka Nâipasal moroitak, a chunga ku mulungtâiriem ani, a he rangâi roi!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Aph 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Bal 18:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lap 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Ruoisingei han rôl hah an rietin chu, an chi rai sikin pila an inbokraka. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Jisua an kôm a honga, a tôn ngeia, “Inthoi roi, chi no roi,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Masikin an ena, Jisua telloiin chu tute adang mu mak ngei.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Muol chung renga an juong chumin chu, Jisua'n an kôm, “Miriem Nâipasal hih thina renga ânthoinôk mâka chu nin neinun mu hih tute ril no roi,” tiin chong a pêk ngei zoi.<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Male ruoisingei han Jisua kôm, “Ithomo Balam minchupungeiin Elijah a juong bak rang ani, an ti?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref></char></note> tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Jisua'n, “Adiktakin Elijah a juong bak rang ani,” male “jâttin ama'n cherêl let a tih. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Hannirese, nangni ki ril, Elijah chu a juongsai piel kêng ani zoi, mingeiin lei riet mak ngei, an nunuom an lei lo zoi. Ma angdênin Miriem Nâipasal khom an nunuom an lo rang ani,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11:14</ref></char></note> tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Male ruoisingeiin Baptispu John chungroi an kôm a misîr ani, ti an hong riet zoi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n ramkhori sûr pasalte a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mk 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Mipui ngei kôm an kîr nôkin chu mi inkhat Jisua kôm a honga, a makunga khûkinbilin, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>male “Pu, ka nâipasal chunga inriengmu roh! Ama chu risangol invei ania, a tuong ok zoia, voizet mo meia le tuia ânlet zoia. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Nu ruoisingei kôm ko hong tuonga, aniatachu mindam thei mak ngei,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Jisua'n, “Kho anga iemnaboi rai le mi dikloi mo nin ni zoi! Idôr sôt mo nin kôm ko om rang? Idôr sôt mo nangni ko donsui thei ranga? Pasalte hah ko kôm hong tuong roi!” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Jisua'n ramkhori hah chong a pêka, male pasalte sûng renga hah a hong jôkpaia, ma zoratak han a dam kelen zoi.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Male ruoisingei hah Jisua kôm an honga, “Ithomo keinin te ramkhori hah kin rujûlpai theiloi?” tiin mi riet loiin an rekel chiena.<verse eid="MAT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Taksônna ahundôr nin dônloi sika ani.” “Adiktakin nangni ki ti, taksônna ancham ru te dôr nin dônin chu hi muol kôm hin, ‘Hi renga hih soson vânthon roh!’ tîng nin ta, inthon atih. Neinun nâm nin thothei let rang ani!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhatngei chu archang 21 na an bôksa: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Aniatachu chubaithona le bungêiin vai kêng hi anga hih chu rujûlpai thei ani; tinon chu itên ni thei mak </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Mk 9:29 en roh).</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:21">Mat 21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mk 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Kor 13:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Aniatachu, hi anga hih chu chubaithona le bungêi tinôn chu itên rujûlpai thei nimak,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua a thina rang roi a misîr nôkna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mk 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Ruoisingei hah an rêngin Galilee rama munkhatin an hong suokin chu, Jisua'n an kôm, “Miriem Nâipasal hih mingei kuta min sûrin om a ta, <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>anni han ama that an tih; aniatachu sûnthum suole chu aringin kaithoiin om a tih,” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Ruoisingei chu beidong takin an om zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biekin chôiruol chôi roi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Jisua le a ruoisingei Capernaum an hong tungin chu biekin chôiruol rusuongpu ngeiin Peter kôm an honga, “Nangni Minchupu hin biekin chôiruol a chôi ngâi mo?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Jôk 30:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 38:26">38:26</ref></char></note> tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Peter'n “A chôi ngâi,” tiin a thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Peter hah insûnga a lûtin chu, Jisua'n a lei rokôk masa, “Simon kho angin mo ni mindonlam? Hi rammuola rêngngei kôm hin tumo choîtumngei aninônchu chôiruolngei a chôi ngâi? A ramsûngmingei mo, ramdangmingei mo?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Peter'n, “Ramdangmingei,” tiin a thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Jisua'n, “Asa, mahah aomtie chu a ramsûngmingei chu an chôi nâng mak, tiin chong a mele ani. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Aniatachu hi mingei mulunghoiloi rang hi nuom mak me. Masikin dîla senla rukuoi vavôr roh. Nga no thok masatak bâia han nangma le keima rang biekin chôiruol rukbak rang sumthîr man ni tih. Mahah hong chôi inla, ei chôitum hah an kôm pêk ngei roh,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Tumo alientak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mk 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Ma zora han ruoisingei Jisua kôm an honga, “Invân Rêngrama tumo alientak?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22:24</ref></char></note> tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Masikin Jisua'n nâipangte a koia, an makunga a minding pe ngeia, an kôm, <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>“Adiktakin nangni ki ti, nin hong inthûla, nâipangte ngei angin nin om nônchu invân Rêngrama lût thei tet no tunui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:15">Mk 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:17">Luk 18:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Invân Rêngrama alientak chu amananâkin nuninêma hi nâipangte anga hong om hih ani. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Male tukhom ki riming sika hi nâipangte anga lei modôm chu keima mi modôm an ni.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sietna ranga methêmna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mk 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>“Tukhomin ka chunga taksônna dônngei lâia nâipangte inkhat khom hih a minpalin chu a ringa bu nôina lung lienpa minlîn tuikhanglien inthûk taka inchôm senla ata rangin sa uol atih. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Mingei an taksônna minmang pe ngâi neinunngei sikin rammuol rangin ichi aom bâk na! Inpalna ngei chu om bang a ta, aniatachu, inpalna ngei min ompu chungroi chu ichi aombâk na! <verse eid="MAT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>Nu kutin mo, ne ke'n mo, nang aminpalin chu tan pai inla, pai kelen roh! Kut inik mo, ke inik mo dôna kumtuong meidîla nang pai nêkin chu kut boi mo, ke boia mo ringna han lût chu na ta rangin asa uol.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mat 5:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Ni mit khomin nang aminpalin chu kêlpai inla, pai kelen roh! Mit inik dôna meidîla nang pai nêkin chu inkhat vai dôna ringna taka lût chu na ta rangin asa uol ani.”<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Belri inmang chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>“En roi, hi mi chînte ngei lâia inkhat luo hih mumâkloi rangin indîn roi. Invâna an vântîrtonngei hih invâna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhatngei chu archang 11 na hi an bôksa: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Miriem Nâipasal hi ânmangngei sanminringa juong ani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:10 </char></note> ka Pa makunga an om tit ngâi ti nangni ki ril. <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>Miriem Nâipasal hi ânmang ngei roka, sanminring rang piela juong ani.<verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>“Mi inkhatin belri razakhat dôn senla, an lâia inkhat inmang rese, kho angin mo a tho rangin nin mindôn? Sômkuoleikuo ngei hah muol panga bu min sâk a ta, male sêng a ta, ânmangpu hah va rok a tih. <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Nangni ki ril, ava manin chu sômkuoleikuo ânmangloi ngei nêkin inkhatpu chunga han a râisân uol ok a tih. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Ma angdênin, hi mi chînte ngei lâia inkhat inmang khom hih nin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nin; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhatngei an dôn </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ka.</char></note> Pa invâna omin nuom mak.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lâibung aninônchu sarnu sietna sin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>“Na lâibungpa nang doiin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhatngei chu dôn mak ngei </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nang doiin.</char></note> sietna a sinin chu, senla a minchâina min mûn la, dâirekin nin ruona riet rang vaiin ril roh. No chong a rangâiin chu na lâibungpa hah ne mene nôk nîng a tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luk 17:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Aniatachu no chong a rangâi nôn chu midang inkhat mini, inik mini tuong sân la, masikin Pathien lekhabu'n a ti anghan, saloinônna chong nâm hah rietpuipungei mi inik mo, inthum mo bâia mindet ani theina rangin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Bal 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Hanchu an chong khom arngâi non chu, neinun murdi koiindang kôm min tung roh. Azoinataka chu koiindang chong khom a rangâi nuom nôn chu ha mi hah chu sonong anghan mini, sum rusuongpu angin mini be roh.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khap le phal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>“Masikin nin rêngin nangni ki ril: pilchunga nin khap kai invâna khap nîng a ta, pilchunga nin phal kai invâna phal nîng atih.<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>“Nangni ki ril uol sa: pilchunga hin mi inikin nin ngênna han nin inruolin chu, invâna ka Pa'n nangni tho pe a tih. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Mi inik mo, inthum mo ki riminga an hong intûpna muna han anni leh ko om ngâi sikin,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tîrlâm ngâidamloi chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Male Peter hah Jisua kôm a honga, “Pumapa ka lâibungpa'n ku chunga sietna sin bang senla, voizet mo ka ngâidam rang? Voi sari mo?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21-22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:3-4">Luk 17:3-4</ref></char></note> tiin a rekela.<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Nimak, voi sari ni loiin, voi sômsari mun sari tena,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Voi sômsari mun sari; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">voi sômsari lei sari.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:24">Aph 4:24</ref></char></note> tiin a thuona, <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>“Invân Rêngram chu, voikhat chu rêngpa inkhatin a tîrlâmngei kôm an sum thurchi enmindik ranga masatpu angin ani sikin. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>A hong enmindik phutin chu mi inkhat talent isângsôm intâng a kôm an hong tuonga. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Ma tîrlâm han a lakâi pêk rang ahundôr a dônloi sikin rêngpa han ama, a lômnu, a nâingei leh a dôn murdi juorin, a lakâi thuon rangin chong a pêka. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Tîrlâm han rêngpa makunga khûkinbilin ânboka. ‘Ka chunga nu phûkminsei viet inla, anrêngin nang thuon let ki tih!’ tiin ânvûia. <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Rêngpa han inrieng a mua, hanchu a lakâi hah a ngâidam phara, a min se zoi.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>“Hanchu ha mi hah a jôkpaia, a tîrlâm champui ngei lâia inkhat duli razakhat intâng ava mua. Ava sûrrapa, a ringôn a sôm pea, Na lakâi hah ni thuon ta roh!” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>A tîrlâm champui hah ânbôka, “Ku chunga nu phûkminsei viet inla, nang thuon ki tih!” tiin ânvuia. <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Hannirese nuom maka; manêkin a lakâi a thuon mâka chu intâng ina a khum zoi. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Tîrlâm dang ngeiin a sintho lam hah an mûn chu an mulunghoi maka, rêngpa kôm an sea, neinun nâm an va misîr pea. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Masikin rêngpa han tîrlâm hah a koia, a kôm, Nangma tîrlâm kâmnângloi! nên vûi sikin na lakâi murdi nang ka ngâidam ani. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Keiman nu chunga moroina ko dôn anghan, nang khomin ni tîrlâm champui chunga moroina no dôn rang kêng ani, a tipea. <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Rêngpa hah atakasi sabaka, male ha tîrlâm hah a lakâi a thuon suo mâka rangin intâng ina a khum zoi.<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>Jisua'n, “Ma angdênin mitinin nin lâibungngei nin mulungrîl tatak renga nin ngâidam nônchu invâna ka Pa khomin nin chunga ma angdênin thông a tih,” tiin chongkhârnân a ti ani.<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Inmâkna roia Jisua minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mk 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Jisua'n ha chongngei hah a misîr suole chu Galilee ram renga a suoka, Jordan Tuidung râla Judea rama a sea. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Mipui tamtakin an jûia, male ma muna han a mindam ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Pharisee senkhatngei a kôm an honga, ama min ôk rang pûtin, “I-ihsika khomin min a lômnu a mâk hih ei Balamin aphal mo?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Jisua'n an kôm, Pathien lekhabu'n, “Aphut renga miriemngei Mizirpu'n Pasal le nupang a sin, a ti hah nin pore ngâiloi mini?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Aph 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>Mapêna, Pathien'n, ‘Hi sika hin pasalin a nu le a pa mâk a ta, a lômnu leh inruol an ta, male, an ruonin takpum khat hongni an tih,’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aph 2:24</ref></char></note> a ti ani. <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Masikin mi inik nikhâi mak ngeia, pumkhat kêng an ni zoi. Pathien'n munkhata a mozomsai chu miriemin an sensâi tet rang nimak,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Phariseengei han a kôm, “Nônte ithomo Moses'n pasalin inmâkna lekha miziekin a lômnu a pêkin chu inmâk a phalin amanu hah tîrpaiin aom ngâia?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Bal 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat 5:31</ref></char></note> tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Moses'n nin lômnungei mâk rang nangni a phal pena chu nin mulung ânngara minchu nin intak rai sika ani. Hannirese, sinphuta han chu ma anghin nimak. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Hanchu, keima nangni ki ril chu, tukhom pasalin a lômnu hah roi danga niloiin, taksôn omloina sika a mâka anin chu a lômnu hah inrê a minchang ani; male mi lômnu mâksai inneipui nôkpu chu amanu hah a inrêpuiin theiloi a chang sa ani,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Kor 7:10-11</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>A ruoisingeiin a kôm, “Lômpa le lômnu kongkâra ma anghan anin chu innei loi asa uol,” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Hi minchuna hih mitin chunga mang rang nimaka, Pathien'n a pêk ngei chunga vai mang nîng atih, tiin a thuona. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Pasalin innei theiloina abi chu adadang aom: senkhat, chu neiloi rang piela suok an ni; senkhat chu ha anga ranga miriemin an sin khom an om; senkhat chu invân Rêngram sikin an neiloi ani. Tukhom hi minchuna pom thei kaiin chu pom rese ngei,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua nâipangtengei sat a vur</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mk 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Mi senkhatin nâipangtengei Jisua kôm an chunga a kut a minngam theina rang le chubai tho pe ngei theina rangin an hong tuonga, aniatachu, ruoisingeiin an lei ngoa. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Nâipangtengei ko kôm min hong ungla khap no roi, invân Rêngram chu hi anga mingei ta ani sikin,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>An chunga a kut a minngama male chu a se zoi.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ruotharte mineipa chungroi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mk 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Voikhat chu mi inkhat Jisua kôm a honga, “Minchupu, kumtuong ringna ka man theina rangin imo sin sa ki sin rang?” tiin a rekela.<verse eid="MAT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>“Ithomo asa thurchi mini rekel?” Jisua'n, “Asa chu mi Inkhat vai kêng aom. Ringna han lût nu nuomin chu chongpêkngei hah jôm roh,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Ama han, “Kho chongpêkngei ha mo?” tiin a rekela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-16">Jôk 20:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-20">Bal 5:17-20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Jisua'n, “Mi that no roh; inrê no roh; inru no roh; dikloitakin mi nôn no roh; <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>nu nû le na pa mirit roh; nangma nên lungkham angin nu bungmingei lungkham roh,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Jôk 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Bal 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Och 19:18</ref></char></note> ti ngei hi tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Ruolthartepa han, “Ma chongpêkngei nâm ha chu ko jôm suolet zoi. Imo ki sin rang ala nâng?” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Asa akiphara om nu nuomin chu senla, no dôn murdi juor inla, ma sum hah inriengngei kôm pêk roh, male chu invâna rochon dôn ni tih; masuole chu hong inla, mi hong jûi roh,” a tipea.<verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Ruolthartepa'n ha chong hah a rietin chu ngâisiet takin a rot zoi, mi neipa ani sikin.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Hanchu Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôm, “Adiktakin nangni ki ril: mineingei rangin chu invân Rêngrama lût ântak sabak rang ani. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Nangni ki ril nôk: mineingei Pathien Rêngrama lût nêkin chu ût simphuoi kuora lût bai uol atih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Hi chong hih, ruoisingeiin an rietin chu, an kamâm tataka, “Nônte, tumo saminringin aom thei rang?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Jisua'n anni enlakin an kôm, “Mahih miriem rangin chu nithei maka, aniatachu Pathien rangin chu neinun murdi anithei let,” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Male Peter a hong chonga. A kôm, “En roh, keinin jâttin mâkin nang kin jûia. Imo kin man rang?” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Adiktakin nangni ki ril, Ruol Thar hong om ranga Miriem Nâipasal a rêngsukmun roiinpuitaka ânsung tikin chu nangni ku nûkjûi ngâi sômleinik ngei khom rêngsukmunngeia insung nin ta, Israel jât sômleinik ngei chunga roijêk nin tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:30">Luk 22:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Hanchu tutu keima sika inngei mo, lâibungngei mo, sarnungei mo, pa mo, nu mo, nâingei mo, loi ngei mo, amâkpu ngei chu abâk razakhatin man an ta, kumtuong ringna khom pêk sa nîng an tih. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Aniatachu, atûna amasatakngei khom nûkintatak la nîng an ta, male nûkintatak ngei khom amasatak la nîng an tih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13:30</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Grapebila sinthopungei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>“Invân Rêngram chu mi inkhatin a grapebila mi senkhat inloa sintho rang rokin jîng renga ajôkpai angin ani. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Ama'n a sinthopungei hah asûna duli pêk ngei rangin a jôta, male a grapebila sintho rangin a tîr ngei zoi. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Jîng dâr kuo ânringin chu bazar muna a se nôka, mahan mi senkhat ite tho loia an inding ava mua, <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>masikin an kôm, ‘Nangni khom se ungla, grapebila va sin ungla, rathaman asadên nangni pêk ki tih,’ a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Masikin an se zoi. Hanchu sûn dâr sômleinik le chonûk dâr thuma khom ma angdênin a thoa. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Kholoi dâr rangnga ânring rangtôn bazar muna ava se nôka, mi senkhat ite sin loia ânding chien ava mu ngei nôka. An kôm, ‘Ithomo ite sin loiin mahin sûn nin min hek?’ tiin a rekel ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Anni han a kôm, ‘tutên mi min lo mak ngei,’ tiin an thuona. Asa, hanchu, nangni khom se ungla grapebila sin va tho roi,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>Kholoi ahong nîn chu, a pumapa han a sum vongpu kôm han, “Sinthopu ngei hah koi inla, anûktaka hong inlopu ngei renga phutin amasataka hong inlopu ngei dênin an rathaman pêk ngei roh,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Och 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:15">Bal 24:15</ref></char></note> a tia. <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Kholoi dâr rangnga sintho koppu ngei ha chu duli chit pêk an nia. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Masikin motontaka sintho koppu ngei hah an hongin chu atam uol man rangin an mindona; hannirese anni khom duli chit kêng pêk an ni. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>An sum hah an lâka, a pumapa chunga an chier phut zoi. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>“Hi mi nûktaka hôn lo ngei hi chu dâr khat vai an sinna ania, keini chu nisa luma sûntuonin kin sina, hannoma, keini mi ni pêk dôr nanâk anni khom ne pêka!” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>A pumapa han, an lâia inkhat kôm han, “ ‘Rangâi ta, mal,’ nang huong mu-ung. Ikhomnirse asûna duli loa sintho ranga no jôt ani. <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Atûn na rathaman lâk inla, ni ina se roh. Nangma nang ke pêk dôr hih hi anûktaka a hon lopu khom hih pêk ku nuom ani. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Ka sum chu ki ti lamtaka mang rangin rachamneina dôn mu-ung mo? Aninônchu ka mannarloi sikin na narsa mini?” a tipea.<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Hanchu Jisua'n, “Masikin anûktak ngei hah amotontak la nîng an ta, amotontak ngei hah anûktak la nîng an tih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mk 10:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13:30</ref></char></note> tiin chongkhârnân a tia.<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua a thi rang roi a misîr voithumna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mk 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Jisua Jerusalem tena se lâihan, ruoisingei sômleinik hah an theiin a tuong ngeia, lampuia an lôn pumin inrûkten an kôm, <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>“Rangâi ta u, Jerusalema ei se rang ania, mahan Miriem Nâipasal hi Ochaisingei le Balam minchupungei kuta minsûrin om a tih. Thi rangin theiloimintum an ta, <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>hanchu Jentailngei kuta pêk an ta, anni han munui inzanân mang an ta, vîk an ta, khrosa jêmdel an tih; hannirese sûnthum suole chu aringin kaithoiin om a tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nû inkhat ngêna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mk 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Hanchu Jebedee lômnu hah a nâipasal inik ngei leh Jisua kôm an honga, amakunga khûkinbilin, a lungkhamna a zonga.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Imo nu nuom?” tiin amanu hah a rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Amanu han, “Hi ka nâipasal inik ngei hih Rêng nini tika na chang tieng inkhat no voitieng inkhat min sung rangin chong mênkhâm pe roh,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Jisua'n, nâipasalngei kôm han, “Nin zong hih nin riet loi ani, Tuongna kilât ki nêk rang hih nin nêk thei rang mo?” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">“Thei kin tih,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Ki kilât chu nêk tatak nan ta,” hannirese, “tumo ka chang tieng le ko voi tienga ânsung rang chu keiman zen rangin racham dôn mu-ung. Hi munngei hih chu ka Pa'n a mintuo pe ngei ta rang kêng ani,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Ruoisi dang sômngei han ma chong hah an rietin chu, lâibung inik ngei chunga an ningathik zoia. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Masikin Jisua'n an rêngin a koitûp ngeia, an kôm, “Jentailngei chunga roijêkpua an phunngei chu an chunga an inlaltatak ngâia, an ruoipungei khom an chunga rachamneina an dôn ok ngâi iti nin riet.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25-26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25-26">Luk 22:25-26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Nikhomrese, nin lâia chu ma anghin ani rang nimak. Tukhomin alien a nuomin chu, nin tîrlâm ani bak ngêt rang ani;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>Mapêna, nin lâia tukhomin amotontak ani nuomin chu nin tîrlâm a chang bak ngêt rang ani. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Miriem Nâipasal luo mana min a sin an tho pe rangin juong maka, mi sin tho pe rang le mi tamtak rattan ranga a ringna pêk rangin kêng a juong ani,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mitcho inik a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mk 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Jisua le a ruoisingei Jericho hah an mâkin chu, mipui tamtakin an jûia. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Mitcho inik lampui kôla insungin Jisua a hongvun iti an rietin chu, “David Nâipasal! Kin chunga inrieng mi mu roh, Pu!” tiin an in-ieka.<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Mipui ngei han dâirek rangin an ngo ngeia. Aniatachu anni han, “David Nâipasal! Kin chunga inrieng mimu roh, Pu!” tiin an iniek minring uola.<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Jisua ânngama a koi ngeia, “Imo nangni rangin ni min tho nin nuom?” tiin a rekel ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>“Pu, mitvârna mi ni pêk rang hih kin nuom ani!” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="MAT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Jisua'n an chunga inriengmuna a dôna, an mitngei hah a tôn pe ngeia, voikhatrengin an hong mu thei kelena, a nûk an jûi zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua inlaltakin Jerusalema a lût</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joh 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Jisua le a ruoisingei Jerusalem an hongtung rangtôn Olive Muola Bethphage khuo an hongtunga. Mahan Jisua'n a ruoisingei lâia mi inik a tîr ngeia, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>an kôm, “Nin motona khuo son se ungla, sakuording, akôla ate leh ânthung mu kelen nin tih. Sût ungla, ko kôm hong kai roi. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Tukhomin nin kôm imini an ti khomin, ‘Pumapa'n<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pumapa; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">An Pumapa.</char></note> amin nâng kêng,’ tiin ril ngei roi; hanchu nangni hong min chôi kelen a tih,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Dêipu'n a lei ti sai ahongtung dik theina ranga mahah ahong om ani:<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Zion khopuilien hah ril roh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak 9:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">En ta, ne rêng hah no kôm a hong zoi ani!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Ama hah rangâiinchîn takin sakuording chunga chuongin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">male sakuording ate innoi chunga chuongin,” ti hih.<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Masikin ruoisingei hah an va sea, Jisua'n tho ranga a tipe ngei ang han an va thoa: <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Sakuording leh ate hah an hong kaia, an chunga han an puonngei an dâpa, male Jisua a chuonga. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Mipui tamtakin lampuia an puonngei an dâpa; adangngeiin thingbuo an tuka, lampuia an dâpa. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Mipui Jisua moton tienga lônngei le a nûk tienga jûingei han, “David Nâipasal minpâkin om rese! Pumapa riminga juongpu chu Pathien'n satvur rese! Pathien minpâkin om rese!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Lap 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note> tiin an in-ieka.<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Jisua hah Jerusalem a lûtin chu, khopuilien pumpui anrêngin anin tirnata, “Hi mi hih tu mini?” tiin mipui ngeiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Lokongei han, “Hi mi hih Dêipu Jisua, Galilee ram Nazareth renga ani,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Biekina a se roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joh 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Jisua hah Biekina a lûta, Biekin sûnga neinun juorngei le rochôkngei murdi a rujûlpai ngeia. Sumthûlngei dosângngei le pharvali juorngei sukmunngei khom a nammelet pe ngeia, <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>male an kôm, “Pathien lekhabua Pathien'n, ‘Ki in chu chubaithona in tîng an tih,’ tiin ânziek ani. Hannirese nangnin chu inru ngei inthupna khûrin kêng nin sin hi!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char></note> a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Biekina han mitcho ngei le kholrangei a kôm an honga, a lei mindam ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Ochaisingei le Balam minchupungeiin sinkamâmruoi a sinngei le nâipangngei Biekina, “David Nâipasal kôm Hosanna, Minpâkin om rese!” tia an in-iek hah an mûn chu an ningathik zoia. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Masikin Jisua kôm, “Hi mingei an ti hih ni riet mo?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:2">Lap 8:2</ref> (LXX)</char></note> tiin an rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Jisua'n, “Adiktakin ki riet, Minpâkna akipphar pêk rangin nâipangngei le nâitesenngei nin minchu zoi, ti hih nin la pore tet ngâiloi mini?” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Hanchu Jisua'n anni ngei hah a mâka, khopuilien renga Bethany'a a sea, mahan jân a riek zoi.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n theichang kung khomâk a sâm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mk 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Anangtûk jînga chu khopuilien tieng a kîr nôkin Jisua a vonchâm zoia. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Lampui kôla theichang kung ava mua, male ava pana, hannirese abuongei tiloiin chu ite man mâka. Masikin theichang kung kôm han, “Inra nôk tet khâi no roh!” a tipea. Voikhat rengin theichang kung hah ahong thêm zoi.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Ruoisingeiin maha an mua, an kamâmzala, “Kho angin mo theichang kung hih athêmpiel kelen hi?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Adiktakin nangni ki ril, iemna nin dôna mulungokchâna nin dôn tet nônchu hi theichang kung chunga ko tho ang hin tho thei nin tih. Mahi vai niloiin hi muol kôm khom hin, ‘Inthon inla, tuikhangliena juon pai roh,’ ti ungla juon pai atih. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Nin iemin chu, chubaithoa nin ngên murdi chu man nin tih,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua rachamneina chungroia chongrekel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mk 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Jisua hah Biekina a hong nôka, a minchu lâitakin, Ochaisingei le upangei an honga a kôm, “Tu rachamin mo hi neinunngei hih ni sin? Tumo hi racham nang pêk?” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Chongrekel inkhat kei khomin nangni lei rekel rong, ni nin thuon theiin chu, tu rachamin mo hi neinunngei hih ki sin nangni ril ki tih. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>John Baptisma hah kho renga rachamneina mo: Pathien renga mo, miriem renga mo?” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Anni le anni an inkhal zoia, “Imo ei ti rang hi? ‘Pathien renga tiin ei thuon lakin,’ ama'n ei kôm, ‘Ithomo John hah nin iem loi?’ mi tîng a ta. <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>‘Miriem renga ei ti lakin,’ mipui ngeiin imo minlo rang ei chi, mipui ngeiin John hah Dêipua an be sikin,” an tia. <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Masikin Jisua kôm, “Riet mak me.” tiin an thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Jisua'n an kôm, “Kei khomin tu rachama mo hi neinunngei hih ki sin, nangni ril uol noning,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nâipasal inik ngei chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>“Atûn, Imo nin mindon? Tienlâia han mi inkhatin nâipasal inik a dôna. A nâi ulienpu kôm ava sea, a kôm, ‘Ka Nâipasal, avien chu grapebila senla, sin va tho roh,’ a tia. <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>‘Ama han nuom mu-ung,’ tiin a thuona, aninâka chomolte suole chu a mindon a thûla male a se zoia. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Male inkhat kôm han khom a sea, ma angdênin ava ti nôka. Ama han, ‘O, Pa,’ sêng ki tih, tiin a thuona. Hannirese se maka. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Ha mi inik ngei han tu ha mo an pa nuomlam a sin uol?” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">“Ulienpu han,” tiin an thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Masikin Jisua'n an kôm, “Nangni ki ril: sum rusuongpungei le notizuorngei hin Pathien Rêngrama lût nangni an khêl rang ani hi. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Baptispu John'n lampui dik nin jûi rang nangni a juong min mua, ama lei iem mak cheia; sum rusuongpungei le notizuorngeiin chu an lei iem ani. Nangni chu nin mu suonûk khomin nin mulungbôkngei thûlin ama iem mak chei.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:29-30">7:29-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Grapebila inlo mingei Chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mk 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Jisua'n an kôm nanâk, chongmintêk dang rangâi nôk roi a tia. “Voikhat chu tu mini ram pumapa a oma, hah mi han grapebil a thoa, bêr a minkula, grape epna rang khur a choia, a ngâkna rang in insâng a sina. Hanchu grapebil hah inlo mingei ngâk rang ngei kuta bângin, ram danga khuolchai a se zoia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Isa 5:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Grape mara pot zora ahong tungin chu, ânlo mingei kôm han a chang rangtum va lâk rangin a suokngei a tîra. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Ânlo mingei han a suokngei hah an lei sûra, inkhat an jêma, inkhat an thata, inkhat lung leh an dênga. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Atharin suok dangngei motona nêka tam uolin a tîr nôka, motona ngei angdênin an lei tho nôk rêka. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Anûktaka chu, ‘Ka nâipasal hi chu lei jâ ngêt an tih,’ tiin a nâipasal hah an kôm a tîra. <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Hannirese, ânlo mingei han a nâipasal hah an lei mûn chu, ‘Hi mi hih a pumapa nâipasal ani. Hong roi lei that rei u, male a rochon ei man rang ani!’ an tia. <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Masikin an sûra, grapebil pêntieng an vôrpaia, ama hah an that zoi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>“Atûn, grapebil pumapa a hong tikin, ha ânlo mingei hah imo hong lo ta nih?” tiin Jisua'n a rekela.<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Anni han a kôm, “Ha mi saloi ngei hah that ngei ngêt a ta, grapebil hah ânlo mingei adang, amara pot zora diktaka changrangtum a pêk ngâi rangpu kôm pêng a tih,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Jisua'n an kôm, Pathien Lekhabu'n,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“In sinpu ngeiin lung mangmunboi anga an hengpai hah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">akila lung kâmomtak achang zoi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ma hah Pumapa tho ania;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">ei mitmua hin kamâmom ani! a ti hih nin pore ngâiloi mo?” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Lap 118:22-23</ref></char></note> a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>Jisua'n a bôksa nôka, “Masikin nangni ki ril, Pathien Rêngram hih nin kôm renga lâkpai nîng ata, amara musuo rang mingei kôm pêk nîng atih. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkharngei chu archang 44 na an bôksa: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tutu hi lung chunga inpal chu ahârhârin om an ta; male hi lungin adel vang chu innôichit an tih </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 20:18 en roh.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Tutu hi lung chunga ânpal chu ahârhârin om an ta, hi lungin adel vâng chu innôichit an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Ochaisingei le Phariseengeiin Jisua chongmintêk misîr hah an rietin chu, an chungroi a misîr ani ti an riet zoia. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Masikin ama sûr rang an pût zoi. Aniatachu anni ngei han mipui ngei an chia, mipui ngeiin Jisua hah dêipu'n an be sikin.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Inneina ruolhoi chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Jisua'n mipui ngei a rokôka, chongmintêk a mang nôka. <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>“Invân Rêngram chu rêngpa inkhatin a nâipasal ranga inneina ruolhoi tho leh mintêk ani. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Bukhalâi ot rangin a mîsiel ngei koi rangin a tîrlâmngei a tîra, hannirese hong nuom mak ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Masikin tîrlâm dangngei a tîr nôka, a mi sielngei kôm hi anghin ti rangin chong a be ngeia: ‘Atûn hin bukhalâi ot rangin ki sinsiem suozoi; ke sechalngei le ke serâttuoi vai minthâi ngei ka thata, neinunngei murdi sinsiem suo ani zoi. Inneina bukhalâi ot rangin hong ta roi!’ ti rangin. <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Aniatachu siela omngei han itên lei be mak ngeia, male an sadâi chita an sina: inkhat a loia a sea, inkhat chu a dôra a sea. <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>Midang ngeiin tîrlâmngei hah an sûrrapa an jêm ngeia, an that ngei zoi. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Rêngpa hah a taksi sabaka; masikin a râlmingei a tîra, ha mithatpungei hah a min thatngeia, male an khopuilien khom a min hâl pe ngei zoia. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Hanchu a tîrlâmngei a koia, an kôm, Inneina bukhalâi chu minsûk suo ani zoia, aniatachu ki mi sielngei hah a nêk ruo nimak ngei. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Atûn chu lamliena se ungla, mi nin mu murdi bukhalâi ot rangin hong koi roi, a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Masikin tîrlâmngei hah lamlienngeia an sea, mi an mu murdi, misa le misie; an hong koibûma, inneina in hah mipuiin an sip zoia.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>“Rêngpa hah khuolmingei en rangin ava lûta, inneina puon insil loi mi inkhat ava mua. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Rêngpa han a kôm, ‘Mala, inneina puon insil loiin khoangin mo asûnga no hong lût?’ tiin a rekela. Hannirese ha mi han ite ti maka. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Male rêngpa han a tîrlâmngei kôm, ‘A kut le ke khit ungla, pêntieng ajîngna vôrpai roi. Mahan chap a ta a hâ riel a tih,’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk 13:28</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Hanchu Jisua'n, “Mi siela om chu tamtak an nia, aniatachu, thanga om chu atômte kêng an ni,” tiin chongkhârnân a tia.<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chôiruol pêk roia chongrekel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mk 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Phariseengei hah an jôkpaia male Jisua chongrekelin min ôk rang chang an mintuo zoi. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Hanchu an ruoisi senkhatngei le Herod pâla mi senkhatngei a kôm an tîra, ha mingei han, “Minchupu, chongtak ni misîr ngâi ti kin riet. Tute lunghâng tho uol ngâi mak chea, tute mindona chungroia khom kângdoina dôn loiin miriemngei ta rangin Pathien lungdo chongtak hah ni minchu ngâia. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Hanchu, ni ril ta, imo ni mindon? Roman Rêng Ceasar kôma chôiruol pêk hih ei Balamin ânkal mo, ânkal loi mo?” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Nikhomrese, Jisua'n asaloi an mintuo hah a riet chiena, an kôm, “Nangni Asarotholngei! ithomo ni min ôk rang nin pût hi? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Chôiruol chôi ranga sumthîr hah ni min en ta u!” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Sumthîr hah a kôm an hong chôia, <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>male a rekel ngeia, “Tu mâi rimil le tu riming ngei mo an ni hi?” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Anni han “Ceasar” tiin an thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Masikin Jisua'n an kôm, “Asa, hanchu, Ceasar ta chu Ceasar kôm pêk ungla, Pathien ta chu Pathien kôm pêk roi,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Mahi an rietin chu an kamâm tataka; ama an mâka an rotpat zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thina renga inthoi nôkna roia chongrekel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mk 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Mani sûn nanâk han, Sadducee senkhatngei Jisua kôm an honga mingei hih thina renga inthoi nôk no ni ngei an tia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Sin 23:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>Anni han, “Minchupu, ‘Moses'n mi nâi neiloiin a lômnu thisan senla, a nâipa'n ha meithâi hah luo nôk ngêtin a upa ta rangin nâi a nei pe rang ani,’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Bal 25:5</ref></char></note> a tia. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Atûn hin, kin lâia lâibungrêng sari an oma; ulientakin in a neia, nâi neiloiin a thia, masikin a lômnu hah a nâipa kôm a mâka. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>A nâipa iniknapu chunga khom ma anghan a hong om nôka, a inthumnapu chunga khom, azoinataka sarinapu dênin an luo paka. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Anûktaka chu nupangnu khom a thi zoia. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Atûn, mithi ngei inthoi nôk tika han tu lômnu tak mo ani rang ani zoi? An rêngin laka an luo paka,” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Idôra dikloi ngei mo nin ni zoi! Pathien Lekhabu nônchu Pathien sinthotheina nin riet loi sika kêng ani. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Mithi ngei aringin an inthoinôk tika chu invâna vântîrtonngei angin om an ti zoi, innei khâi noni ngei. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Atûn ithingei aringa an inthoinôkna roi: Pathien'n nangni a misîr pe hah nin la pore tet ngâiloi mini?” a tia <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>Pathien'n, “Keima Abraham Pathien, Isaac Pathien, Jacob Pathien ki ni,” a tia. “Ama chu iringngei Pathien kêng ani, ithingei Pathien nimak,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Jôk 3:6</ref></char></note> tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Mipui ngei han mahi an rietin chu, a minchûna hah an kamâm tatak zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chongpêk roiinpuitak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mk 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Jisua'n Sadduceengei hah a makhal mindokngei tih Phariseengeiin an rietin chu a pâlin an honga, <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>an lâia Balam minchupu inkhatin chongrekelin min ôk rang a bôka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:35-40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Minchupu, Balama hin kho chongpêk tak himo a roiinpuitak?” tiin a rekela. <verse eid="MAT 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “ ‘Pumapa na Pathien chu nu mulungrîl murdi'n, na ratha murdi'n, nu mulungbôk murdi'n lungkham mu roh iti hi,’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Bal 6:5</ref></char></note> ani tiin a thuona. <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Mahih chongpêk roiinpuitak le a kâmomtak ani. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Chongpêk inikna kâmom nôk ân angpui chu: ‘Nangma nên lungkham anghan nu bungmingei lungkham mu roh’ iti hih ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Och 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Moses Balam pumpui le dêipungei minchûna ngei murdi khom hi chongpêk inik chunga hin ânngam let ani,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Messiah chungroia chongrekel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mk 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Pharisee senkhatngei munkhatin an intûp laiin, Jisua'n an kôm, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>“Messiah chungroi hih imo nin mindon? Tu richisuonpâr mo ani?” tiin a rekel ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">“Ama chu David jâisuona mi ani,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Nônte, ithomo Ratha han David hah ‘Pumapa’ tiin a min koi? David'n,<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>‘Pumapa han ka Pumapa kôm a tia:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lap 110:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Ka chang tieng insung tit roh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Na râlngei ne kepha nuoia ka dar suo mâka chu,’ a ti ani.<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>David'n, ‘Pumapa’ tiin a koiin te, i angin mo Messiah hah David richisuonpâr ani thei rang?” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Tutên Jisua hah thuon thei mak ngeia, male mani sûn renga chu tutên ite chongrekel rang ngam khâi mak ngei.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n balam minchupungei le phariseengei renga indîn ranga a rilna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mk 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luk 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n mipuingei le a ruoisingei kôm chong a rila. <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>“Balam minchupungei le Phariseengei hih Moses Balamngei rilminthârpu ngei ni ranga phal an ni. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Masikin itho ranga nangni an be murdi chu nin jômin nin jûi rang ani; Hannirese, an omchan chu jûi no roi, an misîr ngei hih an mang ngâi loi sikin. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Puok arik le apêl intak takngei an siema, mingei chunga an bâng ngâia, aniatachu, ha mingei sanna rangin an kutpârngei luo mang nuom ngâi mak ngei. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>An sintho murdi khom miriem mu rangin kêng an sin ngâi. An machalngei le an bânngei khitna hih Pathien chong miziek ngei hih en ta u, an inrol bâk na! An kâncholiinchuol minvona ngei khom hih en ta u, asei bâk na!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">an kâncholiinchuol minvona ngei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hima minvona ngei ha Pathien kôm inpêkna min-ennân an hak ngâi (Telna 15:37-41 en roh). </char><char style="fp" closed="false">23:5; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:1">Mat 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:38">Tel 15:38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:8">Bal 6:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Ruolhoi thona muna munhoi tatakna ngei le synagog ngeia sukmun asa an ngên ngâia; <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Bazar mun ngeia min chubai an mûk le ‘Minchupu’ tia an koingei an minlut ngâia. <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Nangni chu ‘Minchupu’ tiin koi ni tet no tunui, urêng korong nin nia, minchupu inkhat mang nin dôn sikin. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Pilchung hin tute O, Pa, ti no roi, Pa inkhat mamang invâna nin dôn sikin. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>‘Ruoipu’ ti khomin koi ni no tunui. Messiah mang hih nin ruoipu ani sikin. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Nin lâia a roiinpuitak chu nin tîrlâm ani rang ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26-27">Mat 20:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">10:43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Tutu a omlien kai chu chîn an ta, a omchîn kai chu minlutin om an tih.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua asarotholngei demna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mk 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luk 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>“Nangni Balam minchupungei le Pharisee asarotholngei! Nin chung arik! Invân Rêngram inkhâr hah mingei nin khâr pea; nangni laka lût uol mak cheia mi a lût rang ngei khom nin khap ngâi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:13: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhatngei chu archang 14 an bôksa: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nangni Balam minchupungei le Pharisee asarotholngei! Nin chung arik! Meithâingei sum nin sâk pea, mi huongnân asôt zazan chubai nin tho ngâi; masikin nin dûk tuong rik uol ok atih! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Mk 12:40 en roh).</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>Nangni Balam minchupungei le Pharisee asarotholngei! Nin chung arik! Meithâingei sum nin sâk pea, mi huongnân asôt zazan chubai nin tho ngâi; masikin nin dûk tuong rik uol ok atih! <verse eid="MAT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>Nangni Balam minchupungei le Pharisee asarotholngei! Nin chung arik! Mi inkhat insîrna rangin tuikhanglien le ram pumpui nin sir ngâia; a hong inletin chu ha mi hah nangni nêka bâknika dûkmuna se rangin nin tho ngâi! <verse eid="MAT 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>Nangni ruoipu mitcho, Tukhom Biekin dêna khomâkinsâm chu ite nâng ngâi maka; aniatachu tukhom Biekina rângkachak dêna khomakinsâm chu anângna aom.” Ti ngâi ngei nin chung arik. <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Mitcho inmôlngei! Imo akâm aom uol, rângkachak mo aninônchu rângkachak inthieng Biekin hah mo? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Mapêna Tukhom mâichâm dêna khomakinsâm chu ite anângna omaka, ania mâichâm chunga neinunpêk dêna khomakinsâm chu anângna aom, nin ti sa ngâi. <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Idôra mitcho nin ni! Imo akâmaom uol, neinunpêk minthieng ngâipu mâichâm ha mo, mo neinunpêk ha mo? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Masikin tukhom mâichâm le a chunga neinunpêk aom murdi'n ânsâmdelsa ani. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Tukhom Biekin dêna khomâkinsâm kaiin chu Biekin leh a sûnga Pathien om hah dênin ân sâm ania; <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>male tukhom invân dêna khomâkinsâm chu Pathien sukmun le a chunga insungpu dênin ân sâm ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mat 5:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>Nangni Balam minchupungei le Pharisee asarotholngei! Nin chung arik! Sâkruo avâng ngâi chimungei, lêngmesêr le sâkbakhêr tenah khom sômakhat nin pêk ngâia, hannirese, Balama akâm aom uol, dikna ngei le mulungjûrpuina le iemomna ngei jôm rangin chu lunghâng tho ngâi mak chei. Hi ngei hih nin jôm rang ani, adangngei khom mathân uol loiin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Och 27:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Ruoipu mitcho ngei! Nin tui nêkna thoihir chu nin rithît minsâia, ania saringsei chu nin movol ngâi ani. <verse eid="MAT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>Nangni Balam minchupungei le Pharisee asarotholngei! Nin chung arik! Nin kilât le nin mâirâng pêntieng nin minsâia, a sûngtieng chu, inrûksâkna le indînloi nân ai sip ani. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Pharisee mitcho ngei! Kilât sûngtieng hah minsâi bak ungla, hanchu apêntieng khom sâi sâng atih! <verse eid="MAT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>“Nangni Balam minchupungei le Pharisee asarotholngei! Thân lung, nôtminvâra apêntieng chu en ahoi zata, hannirese, asûngtieng chu ru le ruok athûa sip angha nin ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:3">Sin 23:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Ma anghan mitin mitmua pêntieng chu asa anghan nin inlanga, hannirese, nin sûngtieng chu asarotholna le sietnangeia sipmat nin ni.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua a dûktong rang a misîr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luk 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>“Nangni Balam minchupungei le Pharisee asarotholngei! Nin chung arik! Dêipungei thân nin sinsiama, midikngei riettit nân lungngei nin minvo ngâia; <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>male ei richibulngei om lâia han ei lei omsai nikhom senla, dêipungei thisen an musuok han chu inchel no ih, nin ti ngâi. <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Masikin Dêipungei lei that ngei richia mi nin ni ti nin minlang chak ani. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Se ungla, nin richibulngeiin an lei phut hah minzoi roi. <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Nangni murûlngei le murûl nâingei! Dûkmuna se ranga jêkmasatna renga inmo jôk thei rangin nin insabei?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:34">12:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Masikin nangni ki ril, nin kôm dêipungei, mivârngei, minchupungei juongtîr ka ta, an lâia senkhat chu that nin ta, senkhat chu jêmdel nin ta, senkhat chu synagog ngeia jêm nin ta, khopui ankhat renga khopui ankhata rujûlpai nin tih. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Masikin midiktak Abel thisen renga Biekin le mâichâm kâra Barakia nâipasal, theiloinaboi, Zakaria nin that thisen tena han, pilchunga midikngei thatna sika dûktuongna chu nin chunga la chul atih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Aph 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2 Rich 24:20-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Adiktakin nangni ki ril: ha mingei thatna sika dûktuongna ngei murdi chu atûna mingei chunga chul let atih.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Jerusalem a lungkhamna roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34">Luk 13:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>“Jerusalem, Jerusalem! Dêipungei thata, Pathien'n no kôma thangthei a hongtîr ngei lung leh a dêng thatpu! Ârpuinu'n ate ngei a mantha nuoia ai opbûm ngâi anghan ni mingei anrêngin voizet mo ka bân nuoia opbûm rang ko bôka, hankhoma nuom mak che! <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Masikin nin Biekin hah mâkrakin, a korongin om atih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Jer 22:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Nangni ki ril, ‘Pumapa riminga hong chu Pathien'n satvur rese,’ nin ti mâka chu atûn renga ni mu nôk khâi no tunui a tia.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Lap 118:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Biekin siet rang a misîrna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1">Mk 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luk 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Hanchu, Jisua hah a jôka, Biekin renga a se lâiin Biekin min en rangin a ruoisingei a kôm an honga. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Ama han an kôm, “En roi, Adiktakin nangni ki ril, hitaka lung inkhat luo khom hih amuna om no nih; anrêngin paiin om riei an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Intakna le nuomlona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mk 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Hanchu, Jisua Oliv tângah ânsung lâiin, a ruoisingeiin a theiin an hong intongpuia. “Mi ril ta, hi ngei hih itika mo ai tung rang,” male “Nu juong nôkna rang le rammuol mongna rang minsinna hah imo ai ni rang,” tiin an rekela. <verse eid="MAT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Jisua'n an kôm han, “Tutên nangni an huong loina rangin, indîn roi. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Mi tamtakin, ‘Messiah hah ki ni!’ tiin keima riming songin hong an ta, mi tamtak lei huong an tih. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Nin kôla indoina roi riet nin ta, ala takna indoina roi inthang la riet nin tih, nikhomrese, nin jâmminzal no roi. Ha neinunngei hah chu ahongtung ngêt rang ani, nikhomrese amongna chu lani no nih. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Nam le nam indoi an ta, ram le ram indoi an tih. Muntina mâitâm chul ata, ningnu innîk atih. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Ha ngei hah nâiha aphut chak ang hah ani. <verse eid="MAT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>Hanchu, dûk nangni min tuong rang le nangni that rangin nangni la sûr an tih. Keima sikin nam tinin nangni la mumâk an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Ma tika chu mi tamtakin an taksônna la mâng an ta, lân sûr inlôm an ta, lân mumâk inlôm an tih. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Male, dêipu dikloi tamtak hong suok an ta, mi tamtak la huong an tih. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Hanchu, sietna ala pung rang sikin mi tamtak lungkhamna la dâi atih. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Nikhomrese, tutu among dêna diera tuong chu sanminringin om an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Male, hi ‘Rêngram Thurchi Sa’ hih namtin rietna rangin rammuol pumpuia misîrin la om a ta; male, amongna hong tung atih.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Intakna Ichiom tak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mk 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>“Hanchu, ‘Intakna Ichiom Tak,’ dêipu Daniel ramanga lei misîr hah mûng nin ta, mun inthienga han inding a tih.” (Apore murdi'n aomtie riet rese ngei!)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>“Male Judea rama om ngei hah tânga rot ngêt rese ngei. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Mi a inchunga om khom insûnga a neinun kaisuo rangin chum no rese.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk 17:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Mi loia om khom a puon lâk rangin kîr no rese. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Ha ni han chu nâivongngei le nu nâite pomlâingei chung chu ântak bâk rang na! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Nin rot rang zora hah phalbia mo, sabbathni'n mo ani loina rangin Pathien kôm chubaitho roi. <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Ha zora dûktongna ichiruoi inthang om rang ha chu rammuol insieng renga atûn tena la om ngâi maka, om nôk tet khâi no nih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Chph 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Nikhomsenla, Pathien'n ha sûn ngei hah a minbong zoi; ni no senla vang chu tute ringsuok thei noni ngei. A mi zenngei sikin Pathien'n ha sûn ngei hah minbong a tih.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>“Male, tukhomin nin kôm, ‘En ta, Messiah chu hin a om!’ aninônchu ‘Soson a om!’ an ti khomin iem no roi. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Messiah rothol ngei le dêipu dikloi ngei an la suok rang ani; ha ngei han thei vang senla ngei chu Pathien zen mingei luo an huong theina rangin minsinna sininkhêl le sin kamâmruoi thông an tih. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Rangâi roi! Azora ahongtung mân nangni ki lei ril ani. <verse eid="MAT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>Aninônchu, nin kôm, ‘En ta, ramchâra aom!’ an ti khomin mahan se no roi; aninônchu hin ânthup an ti khomin iem no roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:26-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:23-24">Luk 17:23-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Miriem Nâipasal juong nôk rang chu kôlinleka dapdaptingei sak tieng renga thang tieng tenah ahonginlek anga han ani rang sikin.<verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>“Kho munah khom saruok omna murdia sêlkuru khom intûp an tih.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luk 17:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miriem Nâipasal juong rang roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mk 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>“Ha intakna nikhuongei zoiin chu nisa jîng a ta, thâ vâr khâi nonih, invân renga ârsi ngei tâk a ta, invân sinthotheina ngei hah inphêthet'n om an tih. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Masuole chu Miriem Nâipasal minsinna hah invâna inlang ata; pilchunga mi murdi'n Miriem Nâipasal invâna sûm chunga sinthotheina le inlal taka juong an mu tikin chu chap an tih. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Bekul miring inring tak tum nîng ata, hanchu, a vântîrtonngei hah rammuol rikil minlia tîr a ta, kôlkung renga kangkhat tienga kôlkung dênin a mi zenngei mintûp atih.”<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Theichang kunga minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mk 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>“Ha chongmintêk hah theichang kunga inchu roi. Amachang ahong ringa, ahong innoia, abuo ahong incherin chu kholum ahong nâi zoi tiin nin riet ngâi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Ha angdênin, ma neinunngei murdi hah nin mu'n chu, a zora ahong nâi zoi, ânphut rang ani zoi ti riet roi. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Atûnlâia mingei hih an thi riei mân, hi ngei nâm hih tung let atih ti riettit roi. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Pilchung le invân boi a ta, ko chong chu boi no nih.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tutên anikhuo le a zora riet loi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:23-37">Mk 13:23-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>“Hannirese, ha nikhuo le a zora ha chu Pa telloiin chu tutên riet mak ngei; Invâna vântîrtonngei khomin, Nâipasal khomin. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Miriem Nâipasal juong nôkna chu Noah damlâi angdên han nîng atih. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Tuilien mân, sûn ngeiah han chu Noah rukuonga a lût ni dênin an sâka an nêka, lômnu, lômpa an innei ngâia. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Tui ahongliena, an rêngin an inmang riei mâka chu imo ahongtung ite riet mak ngei. Miriem Nâipasal juong nôkna chu ha ang takah han nîng atih. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Ha tikin chu mi inik loia sin an ta inkhat tuongin om a ta, inkhat mâkin om a tih. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Nupang inik sasum kunga sângsukin om an ta, inkhat mâkin om a ta, Inkhat tuongin om a tih. <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>Masikin inning chien roi, itiknimo nin Pumapa a juong rang riet mak chei. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>In pumapa'n inru hong rang zora hah riet senla chu, lei meng a ta, a neinunngei min muruk no nih, ti hih riet roi. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Masikin nangni khom intûng chienin om roi, nin tûng loi zora takin Miriem Nâipasal a juong rang sikin.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tîrlâm taksônom le taksônomloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>“Tîrlâm taksônom avâr tak, a pun a insûng cherêla, tîrlâm dangngei zora tina an sâk sem pe ranga ulien a minchang chu tumo nini? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>A pu'n a honga, ha anga sin thoa tîrlâm a hong mu ha chu a râisân ani, <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Adiktakin nangni ki ril, a pu han a neinun murdi chunga ajêkpu minchang a tih. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Hannirese, tîrlâm saloi anîn chu, a mulungin ‘Ku pu chu hong vak no nih’ tîng a ta, <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>a tîrlâm champuingei lei jêm a ta, ju inrûingei kâra lei nêkin lei sâk a tih. <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>Male, ha tîrlâm hah a tûng loi lâitak le a riet loi zora takin a pu hong suok pe atih. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>A pu han ât nôinek a ta,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:51 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ât nôinek a ta; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">pêntieng vôrpai a tih.</char></note> asarotholngei chang anga han minchang a tih, Mahan chap a ta, a hâ riel a tih.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Dôngmate sôm ngei chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>“Ma tikin chu, Invân Rêngram hah dôngmate sôm ngei an châtingei chôia, moipumapa don ranga se ngei leh mintêk nîng atih zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:35">Luk 12:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>An lâia mi rangnga hah an inmôla, mi rangnga hah an vâr ani. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Ânmôlngei han, an châtingei an chôia, a tui chôi sa mak ngeia, <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>avârngei han chu an châtingei an chôia, a ûma han a tui khom an chôi sa. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Moipumapa hah a juong innu sikin an in alênmua, an lei inphara. <verse eid="MAT 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>Jânchimrip takah chu ‘Moipumapa a juong zoi! Adon rangin hong suok ta roi’ tia iniek rahang a juong om zoia; <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>hanchu, dôngmate sôm ngei hah an inthoia, an châtingei an minsûka. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Male, ânmôlngei han avârngei kôm han, ‘Nin châtitui hah mi pêk sa roi ba! kin châti athi rang kêng’ an tia. <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Avâr rangnga ngei han, ‘Nangni pêk thei noning ung. Keini leh nangni rangin chu hun nonih. Dôrah se ungla, va rochok roi,’ tiin an thuona. <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Hanchu, dôngmate inmôlngei hah châtitui rochôk rangin an sea, hanchu an se kârin moipumapa hah a juong zoia. Dôngmate rangnga ânthok ngei chu ama leh inbiek ruolhoi tho rangin an lûta, in an khâr zoi. <verse eid="MAT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>Nûkah chu dôngmate dangngei khom an hongtung zoia, O pu, o pu, mi min lût roh! Tiin an in-ieka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:25">Luk 13:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Moipumapa han, Nangni minlût tet no ning! Nangni riet ngâi mu-ung tiin a thuona.” <verse eid="MAT 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Male Jisua'n chongkhârnân, “Intûng chienin om roi, a nikhuo le azora hah nin riet loi sikin,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tîrlâm inthum ngei chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>“Ma tikin chu Invân Rêngram hah mi inkhat khuol a chai rangtoa, a tîrlâmngei a koia, a rochonngei enkol leh mintêk nîng atih zoi. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>An thei lam ang chitin a pêka, inkhat kôm sum isâng rangnga a pêka, inkhat isângnik a pêka, inkhat kôm isâng khat a pêka. Hanchu, khuolchai rangin ânphet zoi. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Tîrlâm isâng rangnga changpu ha chu a se kelena, ava minpunga, isâng rangnga dang ava suo nôka. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Ha anga han tîrlâm isâng nik a changpu ha chu a sea, adang isâng nik a muphung nôka, <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>hannirese, tîrlâm isângkhat a changpu ha chu a sea, khur a choia, a pu sum hah athupa. <verse eid="MAT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>Asôtzan suoleh chu tîrlâmngei an pu hah a hongkîr nôka, an kôm a sum thurchi a minthâr zoia. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Tîrlâm, isâng rangnga changpu hah a honga, isâng rangnga dang a hong pêka, o pu isâng rangnga mi ni pêk hah en ta! hi isâng rangnga adang ke lei man nôk hi a tia. <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>A pu han a kôm, No tho minsa, nangma tîrlâm asa le iemom, atômte chunga taksônomin no om sikin, atampa chunga khom a enkolpu'n nang minchang ki tih. Hong inla, ka râisânna hong chang sa roh! a tia. <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>Hanchu tîrlâm isâng nik changpu hah a honga, O pu, isâng nik mi ni pêk hah en ta! Hi isâng nik dang ke lei man nôk hi! a tia. <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>A pu han a kôm, No tho minsa, nangma, tîrlâm asa le taksônom! Atômte chunga taksônom ni ni sikin, atampa chunga khom a enkolpu'n nang min om ki tih. Hong inla, ka râisânna hong chang sa roh!” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>Hanchu tîrlâm isâng khat changpu hah a honga, O pu, mi inngartak ni ni ti ki riet; nu tu loina khoma na ât ngâia, sachi ne rethe loina munna khom bu ni mintûp ngâia. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Ki chia, masikin ke sea, pil rilah nu sum hah ka va thup ani. En ta hi nata nanâk hah, a tia. <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>A pu han a kôm han, “Nangma tîrlâm puoloi le thaboipa! Ka tu loina khoma ka âtta, sachi kerthe loina khoma bu ki mintûp ngâi ti ni riet na? <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Ha anghan aninte, ithomo ku sum hah sumsiena inah ne lei sie loi, nino senla chu, ko hong nôka hin ku sum hih apung leh ka man rang kêng ai ni. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Atûn chu sum hih a kôm renga lâk ungla, isâng sôm dônpu kôm pêk roi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Tutu a dôn chu pêk mintam uol nîng a ta, dôn ok a tih; tutu a dôn loi kai chu ai dôn chêtte khom lâk pe rip nîng a tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Hi tîrlâm mangmunboi hih pêntieng ajîngna vôrpai roi; mahan chap a ta, a hâ riel a tih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk 13:28</ref></char></note> tiin a rila.<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Azoinataka Roijêkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>“Miriem Nâipasal hih vântîrtonngei murdi leh inlal taka a juong tikin chu Rêngsukmuna insung a ta,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">19:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>male a makunga namtina mingei intûp an tih. Hanchu, belrihôlpu'n kêl le belri a sensâi anghan pâl nikin sensâi a tih. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Midikngei hah a changtieng dar a ta, adangngei hah a voitieng dar a tih. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Hanchu Rêng han a chang tienga mingei kôma han, Hong roi ka pan sat ai vur ngei! Hong ungla, rammuol inzir renga nin ta ranga rêngram minsûk hih hong luo ta roi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Ko von achâmin sâk mi nin pêka, ku tuiânrâlin nêk rang mi nin pêka; khuolmi ki nîn nin ina mi nin mintunga. <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>Dierboiin ko omin puon mi nin min sila; ka damloi zorân mi nin donsûia, intâng ina ko om khomin mi nin pan ngâi,” la tîng a tih. <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Midikngei han, “Pumapa tikhanmo no vonchâmin nang kin mua, sâk nang kin pêka, tui inrâlin nang kin mua nêk rang nang kin pêk? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Tikhanmo khuolmin nang kin mua, kin inah nang kin mintunga, dierboiin nang kin mua, puonsil rang nang kin pêk? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Tikhanmo damloiin mo, intâng ina mo nang kin mua, nang kan pan ngâia?” <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Rêng han an kôm, “Nangni ki ril, hi ku sûngsuok achîntak ngei lâia mi inkhat chunga nin sin hah ku chunga nin sin ani,” tiin la tîng a tih. <verse eid="MAT 25:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>“Hanchu a voi tienga mingei kôm han chu, Nangni chu Pathien khomâksâmna nuoia om roi! Diabol le a tîrtonngei ta ranga sin kumtuong meiah han se ta roi! <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Ko von achâmin sâk mi pêk mak cheia, ku tui ânrâlin nêk rang mi pêk mak cheia; <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Khuolmi kinîn nin inah mi mintung mak cheia, dierboiin ko omin puon ni min sil mak cheia, damloiin le intâng ina ko om khomin mi pan ngâi mak chei,” la tîng a tih. <verse eid="MAT 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>Hanchu anni han an kôm, “Pumapa tikhanmo no von achâmin mo, tui ânrâlin mo, khuolmin mo, dierboiin mo, damloiin mo, intâng ina mo nang kin mua, ni sin nang kin tho pe ngâi loi?” Tiin la thuon an tih. <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Rêng han an kôm, “Nangni ki ril, hi mi chînte ngei lâia inkhat chunga nin sin nuom loi chu ku chunga nin sin loi ani,” la tîng a tih. <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>“Hi mingei hih kumtuong dûktuongna sêng an ta, hannirese, midikngei chu kumtuonga ringna han sêng an tih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua that rangtie an mintuo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joh 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Hanchu Jisua'n ha chongngei murdi hah a ril zoiin chu a ruoisingei kôm, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>“Sûnnik suoleh, Kalkân kût hong om atih iti nin rieta. Miriem Nâipasal hih jêmdel rangin pêk nîng atih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Jôk 12:1-27</ref></char></note> a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Hanchu ochaisingei le Upangei hah Ochai Inlal Caiaphas inpuia intongna an neia, <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>inrûkin an sûra, an that rang lam an mintuoa. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Nikhomrese, “Kût sûngin chu ni no rese, mipui lâia injêlna tete om duoi nih,” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bethany'a Jisua sariek polin a om</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mk 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Joh 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Hanchu, Jisua hah Bethany'a aphârpa Simon inah a oma. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Jisua bu a nêk lâitakin, nupang inkhat alabaster bilôrin sariek mirimhoi man luttak ahong chôia, a luah a buok pea. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Ruoisingeiin an mu inchu an ningathika. “Irangmo hi anga a inchek hi? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Hi mirimhoi hih man tamtaka zuora, inriengngei kôma sem thei kêng ani,” an tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Jisua'n an ti ngei hah a rieta, an kôm, “Ithomo hi nupangnu hih nin rokôk? kata rangin sin asa le enhoi tak ai tho ani. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Inriengngei chu nin kôma om tit an nia, hannirese, kei chu nin kôma om bang noning. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Hi sariek mirimhoi ka takpuma ai buok hih phûm ranga ni sinsiamna ranga ai tho ani. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Atûn, chongdiktak nangni ki ril, rammuol pumpuia thurchisa an misîrna nâma, hi nupangnu sintho khom hih ama riettitna rangin misîr sa ngâi an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Juda'n Jisua minsûr rang a nuom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mk 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Masuole Ruoisi sômleinik ngei lâia inkhat a riming Judas Iscariot an ti hah ochaisingei kôm a sea <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>Male ama'n, “Jisua nangni ki minsûr inte imo mi nin pêk rang?” a tia. Anni han sumdâr sômthum an tela ama an pêka. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Masuo renga chu Judas han Jisua an kuta a pêk theina rangin chuminrên a rok tit zoi.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua a ruoisingei leh kalkân ruoi an sâk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joh 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Cholboivâipôl Kût ni sûn motontakah han, ruoisingei an honga, Jisua kôm, “Kalkân Kût hih khotieng mo va minsûk unglang nu nuom?” tiin an rekela. <verse eid="MAT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Ama han an kôm, “khopuiliena mi inkhat kôm se ungla, a kôm. ‘Minchupu'n ko zora anâi zoia; ku ruoisingei leh Kalkân Kût ni inah mang kin tih,’ a ti va ti roi,” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Jisua'n an kôm he a be lam angtakin an thoa, Kalkân Kût hah an va minsûk zoia. <verse eid="MAT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Kholoi ahong nînchu, Jisua le ruoisi sômleinik hah khalâi ottin an insung lâiin. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Khalâi an ot lâitakin Jisua'n an kôm, “Nangni ki ril, nin lâia mi inkhat hin ni minsûr a tih,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Hanchu ruoisingei mulung dûkatonga, a kôm, “Pumapa, keima mo mi ni ti?” tiin inkhat inkhatin an rekel paka. <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Khênga vâipôl mi pûrpuipu hin ni minsûr a tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Lap 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Pathien Lekhabu'n ai ti anghan, Miriem Nâipasal hih thîng a tih, nikhomrese, Miriem Nâipasal minsûrpu chung chu arik bâk rang na! Ha miriem ha chu ânzir tetloi nisenla ata rangin sa uol a tih,” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>A minsûr rangpu Judas hah a hongchonga, “Minchupu, keima mo mini ti tatak?” tiin a rekela. Jisua'n a kôm, “Nên ti hate” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pumapa Jânbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Hanchu an sâk lâitakin, Jisua'n vâipôl a lâka, râisânchong a ril zoiin chu a khoia, a ruoisingei kôm a pêka, an kôma, “Lâk ungla, sâk roi, hi hih ka taksa ani,” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Masuole chu, kilât a lâka, Pathien kôm râisânchong a ril zoiin chu an kôm a pêka, “Nêk roi, nin rêngin; <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>ma hih ki thisen mi tamtak nunsie ngâidamna ranga suok rang, Pathien chonginkhit mindet rang chu ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Jôk 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Nangni ki ril, Ka Pa Rêngrama nangni leh uain thar ke nêk ni atung mâka chu hi uain hih nêk nôk khâi no ning,” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Masuole chu la inkhat an thoa, an tho suolechu Oliv tâng tieng an se zoi.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter'n a minlêm rang Jisua'n a leiril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joh 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Hanchu Jisua'n an kôm, “Avien jân lelea hin nin rêngin rot let nin ta, ni mâk riei nin tih, Pathien Lekhabu'n, ‘Pathien'n belrihôlpu hah that an ta, belringei hah chekinchâi chit an tih,’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zak 13:7</ref></char></note> a ti sikin. <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>nikhomrese, kên thoinôk suoleh Galilee rama nin motona lei sêng ki tih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat 28:16</ref></char></note> a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Peter'n a kôm, “Adangngeiin nang mâk riei khomrese ngei, keiman chu nang mâk tet no ning!” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Jisua'n Peter kôm, “Nang ki ril, avien jân ârkhuong mân nangma'n voithum keima hih riet ngâi mu-ung ni tîng ni tih,” a tipea. <verse eid="MAT 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Peter'n a kôm, “Ni thina thisa rang khom nînlang ma anghan ti tet no ning,” tiin a thuona. Ruoisi dangngei khomin ha angdên han an ti paka.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gethsemani ruhuona Jisua chubaitho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-43">Mk 14:32-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Hanchu Jisua hah a ruoisingei leh munkhatin Gethsemani an tina han an sea, Jisua'n an kôm, “Soson chubai ka va tho sûngkâr chu hin lên sung roi,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Peter le Jebedee nâipasal inik ngei hah a tuonga, Rathainvâina le mulungdûk tongnân ahong sipa, <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>male an kôm, “ka mulungdûk atong raia athi rang dôrin kêng ki ni zoi. Hin om ungla mên ning pui roi,” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Hanchu, mântieng ava se uol vieta, pila ânboka, chubai a thoa, “O Pa, anitheiin chu, hi tuongna kilât hih ko kôm renga ni khâi pai pe roh! Nikhomrese, keima racham niloiin nangma racham ni rese,” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Masuole chu a hongkîr nôka, ruoisi inthum ngei hah an inin a hong mua; Peter kôm, “Inmo nangni inthum hite dârkâr khat luo khom mi inningpui thei loi tie hi? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Huongna nin lût loina rangin intûng chienin chubai roi. Ratha'n chu a nuoma, taksa'n ai phari loi ani” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Hanchu, avoiniknân Jisua a se nôka, a chubai nôka, “O pa hi tuongna kilât hi ke nêk loia pai thei aninônchu nangma racham ni rese,” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>A hong nôkin chu ruoisingei hah ain dênin a mu nôka; an mitngei reng an meng zoi loi sikin. <verse eid="MAT 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Jisua'n a mâk ngei nôka, a voithumnân a ti nanâk hah tiin chubai a tho nôka. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Male ruoisingei kôm a hong nôka, an kôm, “Atûn tena inngamin nin la in bang na? En ta u, Miriem Nâipasal hih mi nunsiengei kuta pêk rang zora ahongtung zoi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Inthoi ungla, sêng ei ti zoi. En ta u, ni sûr rangpu hih ahong nâi zoi!” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua an sûr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Joh 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Hanchu, Jisua a chong la mong loiin ruoisi sômleinik ngei lâia Judas hah a hong tunga. Ama lômin Ochaisingei le Upangei hongtîr mipui, khandai le tôkmol chôiin an hong sa. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>A minsûr rangpu han, “A bieng ku tum takhah nin rokpu nîng a tih, sûr kelen roi!” tiin minsinna a lei pêksai ani. <verse eid="MAT 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Judas hah Jisua kôm a se pata, a kôm, “Minchupu, nu chunga rathanngamna om rese,” tiin a bieng a tuma. <verse eid="MAT 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Mal, no hongna abi tho kelen roh!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:50 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mal, no hongna abi tho kelen roh! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mal ithomo mahin no honga?</char></note> a ti pea,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Hanchu an honga, Jisua hah an sûr zoi. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Jisua kôma om ngei lâia inkhatin a khandai a leka Ochai Inlaltak, a tîrlâmpa kuor a tukthâk pea. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Na khandai hah a koka thun nôk ta roh. khandai a lek ngei chu khandai nanâkin thîng an tih. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Ka Pa kôm sanna ko zong theia, ama'n voikhatrengin vântîrton isâng ruk pâl sômleinik nêka tam a juongtîr thei iti ni riet loi mini? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Nikhomrese, ngên ta inlang, i angin mo Pathien chong hih hi anga hong iom rang hih ai tung thei ranga?” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n lokongei kôm han, “Khandai leh tôkmol chôiin inru sûr rang leh in-ang bangin misûr rangin nin hong na? Nîngtin Biekinah kên sunga, ki minchu ngâia, mahan misûr mak cheia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:55: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Nikhomrese, dêipungei chong miziek ngei hah ahong tung dik theina rangin, hi ngei murdi hih a hong iom ani hi,” a tia. Hanchu, ruoisingei murdi'n ama an mâk raka an rêngin an rot riei zoi.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua roijêkna makunga ânding</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mk 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luk 22:54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Joh 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Hanchu, Jisua sûrngei han, Ochai Inlaltak Caiaphas inah Balam minchupungei le Upangei lei intûpna han an tuong zoia. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Peter'n alazanin a jûia, Ochai Inlaltak in khalâi dênin a jûia. Khalâidung a lûta a mongna mu rang nuomin a rungpungei kâra han ânsunga. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Jisua an that theina rangin Ochaisingei le roijêkpu murdi han theiloi an mintum theina rang abi an roka; <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>nikhomrese, mu mak ngei, mi tamtak hongin a chungroia milak ril khom senla ngei. Anûktakah mi inik an honga, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>male, “Hi mi hin, Biekin hih setin sûnthumin ki sin nôk thei,” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Joh 2:19</ref></char></note> a ti an tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Ochai Inlaltak hah ândinga, Jisua kôm, “Hi nang an nônna roia hin ite thuonna ni nei loi rang mo?” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Nikhomrese, Jisua chu a dâireka. Ochai Inlaltak han arkôk nôka, “Pathien aring rimingin nang ki ti; ni ril roh, Pathien Nâipasal Messiah hah nini mo?” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Ni na ti hate. Mahah ninôn khom nang ki ril; atûn renga Miriem Nâipasal hih Râtinchung chang tienga, insunga, invâna sûm chunga juong la mûng nin tih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:64: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref></char></note> a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Ochai Inlal han a puonsilngei a potkhêra, “Pathien a rilsiet zoi; Rietpuipu dang nâng khâi mak meh! Pathien a rilsiet tie chu nin riet zoi! <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>I angin mo nin mindon?” a tia. Anni han, “A tho minchâi, athi ngêt rang ani” an tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Hanchu a mâia an michila male an jêma; senkhatin,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:67: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">Isa 50:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>“Ni ril roh, Messiah, Tumo nang a jêm?” tiin an bêna.<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter'n Jisua a minlêm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mk 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Joh 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Hanchu, Peter hah rukul sûng khalâiah ânsunga, Ochai Inlaltak tîrlâm dôngmate inkhat a honga, a kôm, “Nang khom, Jisua Galilee rama mi kôm no om ngâi,” a tipea. <verse eid="MAT 26:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Hannirese, an rênga makunga a minlêma. “I thurchi mo nin misîr reng riet mu-ung” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Rukul mokot pêntieng ava jôka, tîrlâm dôngmate dangin a lei mu nôka. Ha takah omngei kôma han, “Hi mi hih, Nazareth Jisua kôma a om ngâi” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 26:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Peter'n a minlêm nôka, “Khomâk insâmin ki ti ani, ha mi hah riet mu-ung!” a ti nôka. <verse eid="MAT 26:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Chomolte suoleh chu hataka inding ngei hah Peter kôm an honga, a kôm, “Nang khom an lâia mi nini khet, No chong lam renga hin ei riet thei!” an tipea. <verse eid="MAT 26:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Male Peter'n an kôm, “Chongdik rillin khomâk kên sâm ani! Adik nônchu Pathien'n dûk ni mintong rese! Ha mi hah riet tet mu-ung!” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Masuolechu âr akhuong kelen zoi, <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>male Peter han, Jisua'n a kôma, “Âr akhuong mân voithum ni minlêm ni tih,” ai tipe chong hah a hong rietsuok nôka. A jôka a chap ngu-ngui zoi.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua Pilat makunga ânding</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mk 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Joh 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Jîng ahongnin chu Ochaisingei murdi le Upangei han Jisua that rang lampui an sinna. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Zingjirûiin an khita, an tuonga, Pilat, Rom râiôt kôm an pêka.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judas thina roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Sin 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>A minsûrpu Judas han, Jisua theiloi an mintum ti a riet inchu ânsîra, a sumdâr sômthum hah Ochaisingei le Upangei kôm a hongchôi nôka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Sin 1:18-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>“Midik thi ranga ki minsûr ha chu ki minchâi sabak kêng ani zoi,” a tia. Anni han a kôm han,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">“Mahah kan ta rangin imo asena. Maha chu nangma sintho kêng!” an tipea. <verse eid="MAT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Judas han ma sumdâr hah Biekin sunga a paia, a rota; hanchu, a sea, avan khâi that zoi. <verse eid="MAT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Ochaisingei han sum hah an rûta, “Mahih chu thisen man sum ani sikin Biekina sum darna munna dar rangin chu inthieng mak” an tia. <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Hanchu, an inruola, ramdangmingei phûmna mun rangin Bêlvuokpu mun an rochôka. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Masikin ma mun hah atûn tena (Akeldama) “Thisen Mun” an ti tit zoi.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Hanchu Dêipu Jeremiah'n, “sumdâr sômthum hah an lâka Israelngeiin ama man ranga adôr an masat hah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zak 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 11:13">13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>male Pumapa chongpêk anghan, bêlvuokpu mun man rangin sum hah an mang zoi,” ai ti hah ahong dik zoi ani.<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilat'n Jisua chong a rekel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mk 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Joh 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Jisua hah Rom râiôt makunga ândinga, râiôt'n, “Judangei rêng nini mo?” tiin chong a rekela, Jisua'n, “Ni ni, ni ni ti zoi hate,” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Hannirese, Ochaisingei le Upangeiin an nônna roia chu itên thuon mak. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Masikin, Pilat'n a kôm, “Nang an nônna roi hih ni riet loi mini?” a tia. <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Nikhomrese, bâikhat luo khomin thuon maka, Râiôt chu asân a kamâma.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua thi ranga a roi an jêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-15">Luk 23:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Joh 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Hanchu Rom râiôt han Kalkân Kût zora racham mi intâng inkhat lokongei an ti tak a mojôk pe ngei ngâia, <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Ha lâia han mi intâng, riming inthang tak Barabbas an ti hah a oma. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Masikin lokongei an hong intûp inchu Pilat han an kôm, “Tu himo nangni mojôk pe inlang nin nuom? Barabbas himo, Jisua Messiah an tipu himo?” tiin a rekela. <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Juda rachamneipungei han Jisua hah an narsa sika a kutah an hong pêk ani ti ânthârtakin a rieta. <verse eid="MAT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Hanchu Pilat hah roijêkna munah ânsung lâitakin a lômnûn, “Ha midik chunga han ite tho no roh, jânin han ka ramangin ama sikin ku tuong ok kêng” tiin chong a hong bea. <verse eid="MAT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Ochaisingei le Upangeiin Barabbas mojôka Jisua that ranga Pilat kôma ngên rangin mipui ngei an methêma. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Hannirese Pilat'n mipui ngei kôm han, “Hi mi inik ngei lâia hin tu himo nangni mojôk pe ronga nin nuom?” tiin a rekela. Anni han, “Barabbas” tiin an thuona. <verse eid="MAT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilat'n an kôm, “Hanchu, Jisua Messiah an ti hih, imo ko lo rang ani zoi?” tiin a rekel ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">“Khrosa jêmdel roh” tiin an thuona <verse eid="MAT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Nikhomrese, Pilat'n an kôm, “Imo ai tho minchâi?” tiin a rekel ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">“Khrosa jêmdel roh!” tiin an rât dodôrin an inieka. <verse eid="MAT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Pilat'n ite anêmna om no nia, injêlna vai kêng ai suok rang ti amun chu tui a lâka, lokongei makunga a kut a rusuka, an kôm, “Hi miriem thina hin ite theiloina dôn mu-ung! Mahih nin sintho kêng ani!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:6-9">Bal 21:6-9</ref></char></note> a tia. <verse eid="MAT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Loko murdi'n, “Hi mi thina sika dûk chu keini le kin nâingei chungah chul rese!” an tia. <verse eid="MAT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Hanchu Pilat'n Barabbas hah a mojôk pe ngeia; male Jisua hah a jêm suolechu Khrosa jêmdel rangin an kutah a pêk ngei zoi.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Râlmingeiin Jisua an phengsan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mk 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Joh 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Hanchu, Pilat râlmingei'n Jisua hah râiôt inpuia an tuonga, an pâla mi murdi a kôla an intûpa. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>A puonngei an lîk pea, puon senduk an minsila. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Male, riling tapor an phana, an min khuma, a kut chang tieng khiengrol an min chôia; a makungah khûkinbilin, “Juda ngei Rêng ring sôt roh!” tiin an phengsana. <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>An michila, a khiengrol hah an suta, a luah an tôka. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Hanchu, an phengsan suolechu puon senduk hah an lâk nôka, ama puon dên hah an minsil nôka. Hanchu, Khrosa jêmdel rangin an tuong zoi.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua jêmdela a om</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joh 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Hanchu, an se lâiin Cyrene khuo mi inkhat a riming Simon an tonga, râlmingei'n Jisua Khros ruput rangin an dândea. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Golgotha, “Luru Mun” an ti hah an hong tunga, <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Mahan Jisua hah uain, tuikha leh inpol an pêka, a tem zoiin chu nêk nuom maka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Lap 69:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Hanchu, Khrosa an jêmdela, male, taruosânin a puonsilngei an insema.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Lap 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Masuole chu, mahan insungin, an enna. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>A lu chungah an nônna miziek, “Hi mi hih Jisua, Judangei Rêng ani,” tiin an târa. <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Hanchu, ama leh lômin inru inik a voitieng inkhat, a changtieng inkhat an jêmdel sa.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Hanchu, ânlôi murdi'n an lu thukin Jisua an deia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Lap 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>“Biekin set na ta, sûnthumin ni minding nôk rang na! Pathien Nâipasal ni nîn chu ne theiin insaninjôk roh! Khros lêr renga juong chum ta roh!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Joh 2:19</ref></char></note> an tia.<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Ma angdên han, Ochaisingei le Balam minchupungei le Upangei khomin ama an deia: <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Mi dangngei laka a minjôk ngâia, ama chu injôk thei maka! Israelngei rêng ni mak mo? Atûn Khros lêr renga juong chum rese chu iem ei tih! <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Pathien a iema, Pathien Nâipasal'n ânbea. Tho lei en rei u, Pathien'n atûn a minjôk nuom mo!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Lap 22:8</ref></char></note> an tia.<verse eid="MAT 27:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Inru, ama leh an jêmdel ngei khomin ha angdênin an dei sa.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua thina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joh 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Hanchu sûn dâr sômleinik renga kholoi dârthum tenah chu rammuol ajîng khapa. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Dârthumin chu Jisua rôl inring takin ânieka, <char style="tl">“Eloi, Eloi, lema Sabacthani?”</char> a tia. Mahah aomtie chu, “Ka Pathien, Ka Pathien, ithomo nina mâksan?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Lap 22:1</ref></char></note> tina ani.<verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Ha munah ânding senkhat ngeiin mahah an rieta, “Elizah ai koi kêng” an tia. <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Hanchu, an lâia mi inkhatin a tâna sponj a lâka, uain thûra a michia, tôkmol mongah a târa, hong min nêk rang a thoa.<verse eid="MAT 27:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Hannirese, mi dang ngeiin, “La ngâk roh, a minjôk rangin Elizah mo a juong lei en bak hi rei” an tia. <verse eid="MAT 27:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Jisua rôl inring takin âniek nôka, arang achat zoi. <verse eid="MAT 27:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Hanchu, Biekina puonjâr hah alu renga among dênin akêr pata. Masuole chu pilchung ânnîka, lungpuingei an koia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Jôk 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>thânngei ahôn onga, Pathien mi tamtak alei thi ngei hah kaithoiin an oma. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Thânngei hah an mâka, Jisua, thina renga ân thoinôk suoleh Khopuilien Inthiengah an lûta mahan mi tamtak kôm an inlâr zoi.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Râlmi ulien le a kôla râlmi aom Jisua thîr ngei han, ningnu innîk le neinun om tie ngei hah an mûn chu an chia, “Hi mi hih Pathien Nâi ani khêt!” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Ma munah han nupang tamtak, Galilee ram renga Jisua nûkjûia asan ngâi ngei han alazanna renga an thîra.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:55,56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luk 8:2-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Ha ngei hah Mary Magdalene ngei Jacob le Joseph nu Mary ngei le Jebedee lômnu ngei an ni.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua an phûm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joh 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Kholoi ahong nin chu mineipa Arimathea khuo mi a riming Joseph a hong tunga; ama khom Jisua ruoisi a lei nia. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Pilat makunga ava sea Jisua ruok hah ava zonga, ruok hah Joseph kôm pêk rangin Pilat'n chong a pêka. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Masikin Joseph han ruok hah a musuma puoninnêm athar leh a thoma, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>male thân lunga iver zoisuobila han a min jâla. Hanchu thân bâi hah lung alienpa leh a hîp zoiin chu a sea. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Mary Magdalene le Mary dang hah thân tieng mâithakin an insunga.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thân ngâkngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Anangtûkah Sabbathni sûnin chu Ochaisingei le Phariseengei hah Pilat kôm an honga, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>male a kôm, “O pu, ha milaka han aring lâiin, ‘Sûnthum suoleh chu inthoinôk ki tih’ a ti kin riet. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:23">17:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:19">20:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Masikin thân hah sûnthum sûng chu asadima ngâk rangin chong pêk roh, a ruoisingeiin an sea, an va muruka, mipui lâia, ‘Thina renga ânthoinôk zoi’ an ti thei loina rangin. Ma anghan aninônchu hi huongna nûktak hih motona nêkin siet uol nih,” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilat'n an kôm, “Râlmi tuong ungla,” male “se ungla thân hah nin thei lam dôra asân min ngâk roi,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Hanchu an sea, thân lung hah sîn thôn, a ngâk rang ngei hah an min ngâk ngei zoi.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Inthoinôkna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mk 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joh 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Sabbathni ahong heka, Pathienni jînga khuo ahongvâra, Mary Magdalene le Mary dang hah thân en rangin an sea. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Inningloiin ningnu râttak ahong innîka, invân renga Pumapa Vântîrton a juonga; lung hah a muluoi paia a chungah ânsunga. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>A mêl chu kôlinlek ang ania, a puonsilngei khom rodokang anga chek ani. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Râlmi a ngâkngei han an chi rai zoi sikin an innîka, athi anghan an oma.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Vântîrton han nupangngei kôm, “Nangni chu chino roi, Jisua an jêmdelpu hah nin rok ani ti ki riet. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Hin om khâi maka; ai ti anghan ân thoinôk zoi. Hin hong ungla, a jâlna hih hong en roi. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Atûn inrangtakin se ungla, a ruoisingei kôm, Thina renga ân thoinôk zoi, Galilee rama nin motona a lei se; mason mûng nin tih! Nangni ki ril hih riettit roi” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Hanchu, ichi le râisânna sipin, thân renga an se lalaia, ruoisingei varil rangin an tân zoi.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Inningloiin Jisua'n anni hah a tonga, an kôm, “Nin chunga rathanngamna om rese” a tia. Hanchu, a kôm an honga, a kepha an sûra, chubai an mûka. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Chino roi, se ungla, Galilee rama se rangin ku sûngsuokngei varil roi; mason ni mûng an tih” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thân ngâkngei chongril</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Nupangngei hah lama an lôn lâitakin thân ngak râlmi senkhatngei hah khopuiliena an kîr nôka, neinun om tie murdi hah ochaisingei an va rila. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Ochaisingei hah Upangei leh anin mua lungvâr an thoa; râlmingei kôm han sum tamtatak an pêka, <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>an kôm, “Jâna kin inkârin a ruoisingei an honga, a ruok an hong muruk ani, tiin misîr roi. <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Râiôt han ha thurchi hah a lei riet lekhom, theiloina dôn mak chei tiin nangni rilpui kin ta, ite nin mulung nin minjîngna rang omak,” an tia.<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Râlmingei han sum hah an lâka, chong an be lam angtakhan an tho zoi. Masikin atûn tenah ha thurchi hah Judangei lâia an la ril minlum bang ngâi ani.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua a ruoisingei kôm ânlâr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joh 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sin 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Hanchu ruoisi sômleikhat ngei hah Galilee rama tâng inkhata Jisua'n se roi a tipe ngeina han an sea.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mk 14:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Ama an mûn chu chubai an mûka, senkhatin iem tatak no khom senla ngei. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Jisua'n ahong nâia, an kôm, “Pilchunga le Invâna rachamneina murdi ko kôm pêk ani zoi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Hanchu, muntina mingei murdi kôm se ungla, ku ruoisîn sin ngei ungla: Pa, Nâipasal le Ratha Inthieng rimingin Baptis ngei ungla,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Sin 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>chong nangni ke pêk murdi jôm rangin ril ngei roi. Male Keima zoratin rammuol mong dênin nin kôma om tit ki tih,” a tia.<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
